<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">JOSHUA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Joshua</para>
  <para style="toc2">JOSHUA</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jos</para>
  <para style="mt1">JOSHUA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Joshua</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Joshua</char> ccauh tuh Moses he a zuipaw Joshua cciakhaenaw te Israel hae nynh Kanaan ram a lawnaw hae kong phungpaw nynh thua. E ccauh lungkhu hin Jordan vaw a zuanaw hae, Jeriko khua a lawnaw hae, Ai khua a dounaw hae, Pachia te a ccungccaw hae laku kya athaw lante byakinnaw a raenaw hae kong a um. E ccauh kya a nyhua hae paw byatue tuh, “Atunin kya na beik lan oh paw kha pokuh oh … kae te ka innbyn hae nynh tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha nynh kae beik cih,” (24.25) acikuhpaw hynh nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Kanaan ram taenaw 1.1—12.24</para>
  <para style="io1">Ram iakunaw 13.1—21.45</para>
  <para style="io2">(a) Jordan nithua lang ram 13.1-33</para>
  <para style="io2">(b) Jordan niccaw lang ram 14.1—19.51</para>
  <para style="io2">(c) Khynnaw khua hae 20.1-9</para>
  <para style="io2">(d) Levi phin hae khua hae 21.1-45</para>
  <para style="io1">Nithua lang e phin hae mih ram lang a ki hae 22.1-34</para>
  <para style="io1">Joshua nynh a hopaw rhohui bya 23.1-16</para>
  <para style="io1">Shekhem kya byakinnaw a thawsah hae 24.1-33</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Pachia nynh Joshua Rya A Pya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu Moses a chih koute, Moses a bawmtu, Nun ccapaw Joshua kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka ryalahtu Moses tuh a chih vae; nang te hynh-e ccungccaw hae balyn nynh Jordan vaw kha zua oh; minmin, Israel hae ka pya cih hae paw ram lungkhu lang tee oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Moses kya bya ka kinpyaku vae hawte, nae ccuphe nynh a sy cihnaw hmin miakaw tuh nanning kae pya vae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:24-25">Deu 11.24-25</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Ramkaw te hynh-e Lebanon kyate vaw lepaw Zufrates vawpi kyacia, Hit hae ram balyn, niccaw lang Rili Lepaw kyacia nae ram lang a tang cih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Na she lungkhu balyn humhung nynh mah na malang te ae thadynnua ngan lan khyh; Moses kya ka um hawte na kya mah ka um cih; kae vua lan khyh, kae cciataw lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Deu 31.6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:5">Heb 13.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Na thawsaesakuh lah, na rawthungsakuh; pawccecize mih minpaaw hae kya pya lan bya ka kinpyaku hae paw ram tuh e ccungccaw hae hynh na ccousah cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6">Deu 31.6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:7">7</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:23">23</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka ryalahtu Moses nynh kaw ae pyapaw phungbya thyhte raeringkute cyi lan na thawsaesakuh lah, myarya na rawthungsakuh; na ccianaw miakaw kya na laan na sui a ua nawlan, na voi na rang lang maekuh nan. <verse number="8" style="v" />E kawbya ccauh hynh na khalang kyate phiakuh nan sah; a lungkhu zeikuhpaw balyn thyhte cyi lan na raeringku thya nawlan khuazi khuadae tuh-e tuh na tua cih; tetuh na tuakunaw hawte accing cih zah na laan na sui a ua cih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Kae nynh kaw phe kae pya vae khaw: Na thawsaesakuh lah, na rawthungsakuh; rih nan, na bungzou nan sah; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia tuh na ccianaw miakaw kya na kya a um,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh ccungccaw hae laku e bawi hae kha, <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ryahmin kya po lekuh lan cceih oh lah, ccungccaw hae kyakhe: ‘Nae vaelooh kha paccynkuh oh; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ccou lan ae pya oh paw ram lungkhu lang teete ccou khylan nin thum lungkhu, e Jordan hynh na zua cih oh,’ cite hopah oh,” cite kaw a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Reuben phin hae, Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin angankuh kyakhe Joshua nynh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.12-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:28-32">Nam 32.28-32</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:18-20">Deu 3.18-20</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:1-6">Jos 22.1-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu Moses nynh, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh haeungnaw hmin kha ae pya cih oh zah, e ram hynh ae pya cih oh,’ cite kaw ae pya oh paw bya kha liathui oh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Nae zu nae ccaaw hae te nae sahiin-awvaw hae tuh Jordan vaw khuraw lang, Moses nynh ae pya oh paw ram kya na cciatawsya cih oh. Thuasalama nanning lakuze a rawhoypaw balyn nynh rhawtuknawpaw zunghe ccyngkute nae uno hae malang khe na cceih cih oh zah na bawm cih oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Nae uno hae nynh mah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh a pya hae paw ram kha ccou hae zah, naemaw hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh haeungnaw a pya mawlaezung hae na bawm cih oh. Tukoute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu Moses nynh ae pya oh paw Jordan khuraw, nithua lang umpaw naemaw ram lang na kithui cih oh zah na ccou cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Minmin nynh Joshua kha khungru hae zah: “Kaw nae pyapaw balyn kha kae cyih cih zah nae sawnaw miakaw lang kae cceih cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />Atyn-are kya Moses bya kae ngae hawte, na bya mah kae ngae cih; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia tuh Moses kya a la um hawte nang na kya mah um vae sah! <verse number="18" style="v" />Humhung zemah na bya kha ei zah, kaw nae pyapaw miakaw kha a zui leipaw tuh chia athua cih. Na thawsaesakuh lah, na rawthungsakuh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jeriko lang Dophitu hae Sawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te Nun ccapaw Joshua nynh pise hae lu ning kha Shittim khua kyate dophitu lang aruh lante saw hae zah, “La cceih oh lah, ram kha la dotua oh, abyapi lante Jeriko khua kha la do oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze cceih hae zah a min Rahab cikuhpaw ohhuanung inn kya tee hae zah a rya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:31">Heb 11.31</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:25">Jam 2.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Te Jeriko siapharan kyakhe, “Ram kha dophi khylan Israel hae abang tuh atu zete oun thua hae,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te Jeriko siapharan nynh Rahab kalan ccungccaw saw hae zah, “Na kalan oun thua hae zah na inn kya oun tee hae paw ccungccaw hae kha oun poukhae hae; pawccecize ram pynpi hynh dophi khylan nynh oun thua hae,” cite a hosahpya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama Rahab nynh tuh-e pise hae lu ning kha ko hae zah a thuruh kou hae te, “Ka kalan pise lu ning oun thua ccaccing hae, thuasalama tei langte nynh oun thua hae cipaw ka nyh khyh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Amoh takaw koikua khaw ccyh khe nynh minmin tuh a pou hae. Teilang nynh a ccia hae cipaw ka nyh khyh. Arangte la deehui oh, phe na phah kho oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama Rahab nynh minmin kha innccuvaw lang kaekhae hae zah, innccuvaw kya a phaepaw buri ku hae kyakhe a thuruh hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw hae nynh Jordan vaw lang cceihpaw laanpi kya vaw zuanaw kyacia a deehui hae. A deehuitu hae he a cceih kou hae te, koikua kha a khaw hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin a i maw hae khe, Rahab nynh innccuvaw lang kae zah, <verse number="9" style="v" />minmin kyakhe, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh e ram hynh ae pya vae oh cipaw kha thuasah, nanning raw kha eih kae ri keiccuze ram lungkhu um hae paw balyn tuh nae malang a thyngkuh hae cipaw kha thuasah ka ny. <verse number="10" style="v" />Izip ram kyate he na pou oh te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae malang khe Rili Se a rousah cipaw kha thuasah, Jordan khuraw lang umpaw Amor hae siapharan lu ning Sihon te Og kha marya na ro oh cipaw kha thuasah kae thae vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Exo 14.21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Nam 21.21-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Te tuh-e tuh he kae thae takaw te, kae bung tuh thyngkuh zah, nanning keiccuze kaening lu kheit kya sanmah rawthungnaw um vae khyh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tuh ahangnaw vaaw te anenaw laephi kya Pachia ccaccing nynh thua. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nae tungvaw thawccinaw ka hoi hawte, nanning nynh mah ka innbyn tungvaw kya thawccinaw na hoiru nawlan oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te bya yn kinpakuh oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka nung te ka paaw, ka raee hae te ka uno hae, minmin te asekuh hae paw balyn kha na haang oh zah, chinaw kyate kae hiinnaw nae luesah nawlan oh, ahmepaw muihsahnaw kha yn pya oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te minmin nynh Rahab kha, “Kae hiinnaw tuh nang na hanlan thua vae sah! E kae ryalaw hynh na ho khyh zetuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh e ram hynh he oun pya te, na tungvaw thawccinaw te lungzinaw kae hoi cih,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Rahab nynh minmin kha thanlan-aw kyate liarui te laekhu lang a sawbung hae, pawccecize a inn tuh khuapi koihnawpaw khualungrua pe khe um zah, amaw tuh khualungrua lungkhu lang te nynh a um. <verse number="16" style="v" />Aning nynh minmin kha, “Ae deehui oh paw nynh ae phya khyh nawlan oh, mua lang la ccue oh. Ae deehui oh paw a ki mawlaezung hae, nin thum cia tuin kya rekuh oh, tukoute tuh po na cceih kho vae oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Minmin nynh amaw kha, “Na kya thyalawkute bya nae kinsakupaw e byakinnaw kyate kae lue nawlan, <verse number="18" style="v" />e ram lungkhu lang he kae tee te, kaening nae sawbungnaw thanlan-aw kyakhe e liarui asepaw hynh na la khiide cih zah, na inn kyakhe na nung te na paaw, na raee hae te na innbyn hae balyn kha na la pum cih hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Nanning laku e lukhakheit nynh na inn thuakaw kyate laanpi lang pou zah a chi lanze, amaw tungvaw accah cih zah, kaening tuh seinaw hoi leipaw kae thua cih; thuasalama na inn lungkhu kya na umkheih oh paw lukhakheit tungvaw kya kuihsaw thua zah a chi lanze, kaening tungvaw accah cih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama e kae ryalaw hynh nae ho lanze, na kya thyalawkute bya nae kinsakupaw e byakinnaw kyate kae lue cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te Rahab nynh, “Nae bya thyhte thua vae sah,” a cipya hae. Aning nynh minmin kha cciasah hae zah a cceih vae hae; te aning nynh liarui asepaw kha thanlan-aw kya a khii.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Te minmin tuh mua langkhe cceih hae zah, a deehuitu hae a ki mawlaezung hae tuin kya nin thum a um hae; a deehuitu hae nynh laanpi takyh kya ccung hae zah paw sanmah muih khyh hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tetuh pise hae lu ning tuh mua langte bua oun rungbung hae. Vaw kha po zua hae zah Nun ccapaw Joshua kya a thua hae te, mih kya acyihkuhpaw balyn kha a hopya hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Minmin nynh Joshua kyakhe, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ram pynpi tuh aening kuih kya oun pya ccaccing vae; tuhpiaze ram lungkhu um hae paw balyn tuh aening keiccuze a rih vae hae,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel hae Jordan Zuanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joshua tuh awkhua takaw te tho zah Israel hae balyn ryte Shittim kyate cceih hae zah Jordan vaw a thua hae. Khuraw lang a zua maw hae, tuin kya ryahmin a tahku hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Nin thum koute bawi hae tuh ryahmin kya khiakuh hae zah, <verse number="3" style="v" />ccungccaw hae kha, “Levi phin ranpibawi hae nynh a puih hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kya-e byakin thingkua kha he na muih oh te, nae umnaw kyate na thokuh cih oh zah na zui cih oh, <verse number="4" style="v" />tuhteze nynh na zui lan oh paw laanpi kha na nyh cih oh, pawccecize e laanpi hynh langmawlya tuh na zui boi khyh oh. Tuhzemah nanning te byakin thingkua tuh dong thong ning loukaw asawkuh cih; a pe lang na naekuh lan khyh oh,” cite kaw a pya hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Joshua nynh ccungccaw hae kha, “Thyaasahku tua oh; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh awkhualan nae kyakhe ngaeangnaw a rae cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Joshua nynh ranpibawi hae kha, “Byakin thingkua kha puih oh lah, ccungccaw hae malang khe cceih oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze byakin thingkua kha puih hae zah ccungccaw hae malang a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua kyakhe, “Israel hae balyn muihnaw kya nang kha atunin te kae hangthung vae cih, tuhteze nynh Moses kya ka la um hawte na kya ka um cipaw kha minmin nynh a nyh cih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te byakin thingkua a puihtu ranpibawi hae kha, ‘Jordan vaw tui kin he na thua oh te, Jordan vawkhu kya na thadyn cih oh,’ cite kaw na pya cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh Israel hae kha, “Hynhlang oun naekuh oh lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia bya kha thaetua oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh, “Ahiinpaw Pachia tuh nae kya um zah, Kanaan hae, Hit hae, Hiv hae, Periz hae, Girgash hae, Amor hae te Jebus hae kha nae malang kyate solei a dee cih hae cipaw tuh hynh-e liate na nyh cih oh: <verse number="11" style="v" />laephi pynpi <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e byakin thingkua tuh nae malang Jordan vaw kha a zua cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel minphuin hae kyate phuin kheit kya-e lu kheit ccite lu haw lae ning kha po oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te laephi pynpi Bawipaw athuapaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e byakin thingkua a puihtu ranpibawi hae ccuphe nynh Jordan tui kha he a sy te, palung langte yn luapaw Jordan tui tuh thoh pae cih zah, san kheit kya tingkute a thadyn cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae tuh Jordan vaw zua khylan mih bu kyate he a pou hae te, byakin thingkua a puihtu ranpibawi hae tuh ccungccaw hae malang a cceih hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Loohrue ccyh balyn kya Jordan vaw tuh varang lang cia pong aleikuh. Tukeiccuze byakin thingkua a puihtu hae tuh Jordan vaw thua hae zah, tuh-e a puihtu ranpibawi hae ccuphe nynh tui kha he a sy te, <verse number="16" style="v" />palung langte aluapaw tui tuh phang thadyn zah, asawnaw umpaw Zerethan khua pe e Adam khua kyacia tui tuh san kheit kya atingkuh thung; Arabah rili cikuhpaw Rili Chih kalan alua hae paw tuh marya a kan hae; te ccungccaw hae tuh Jeriko khua langkhe hawite a zua hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Israel hae balyn tuh laerou kyate vaw khuraw a zua cciamang lya hae te minphuin pynpi nynh laerou kyate khuraw a zua kou hae makhia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua a puihtu ranpibawi hae tuh Jordan vaw angaelung laerou kyakhe phang a thadyn hae.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Gilgal kya Lungbing Haw Lae Ning</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Minphuin pynpi te Jordan vaw kha a zua kou hae te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua kha: <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ccungccaw hae kya-e pise lu haw lae ning, phin kheit ze lu kheit cci po hae lah, <verse number="3" style="v" />‘E kyahin, Jordan vaw angaelung, ranpibawi hae a thadynnaw hae hmin kya-e lung ccanghaw lae ning kha lah oh lah, puih oh, atu khuazi na ryanaw oh hmin kyakhe nung oh,’ cite kawpya hae,” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh Israel hae kya-e pise lu haw lae ning, phin kheit ze lu kheit cci a po hae paw tuh ko hae zah, <verse number="5" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kya-e byakin thingkua malang, Jordan vaw angaelung langkhe cceih oh lah, Israel phin hae phin kheit cci hanlan, lu kheit nynh lung ccangkheit cci kha nae raw te puih oh, <verse number="6" style="v" />tuhteze nynh hynh-e hynh nanning hanlan syntawnaw athua cih. Nyalang ze nae ccaaw hae nynh, ‘E lung hae hynh nae hanlan paw suilan mou athua?’ cite ae khia oh ze, <verse number="7" style="v" />nanning nynh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua malang Jordan tui tuh thoh paekuh, cite na hopah cih oh. Jordan vaw kha he a zua hae tuh Jordan tui tuh thoh pae. Tukeiccuze e lung hae tuh Israel hae hanlan zungzae liathuinaw lang a tang cih,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh kaw a pya hae hawte Israel hae nynh a cyi hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua a hopya thyhte Israel phin hae zeih khate, Jordan vaw lungkhu e lung ccanghaw lae ning tuh lah hae zah, a ryanaw hae hmin lang puih hae zah a nung hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />(Byakin thingkua a puihtu ranpibawi hae thadynnaw, Jordan vaw angaelung khe Joshua nynh lung ccanghaw lae ning kha bing zah tuh-e lung hae tuh atunin cia a um hae.)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Moses nynh Joshua kaw a pya thyhte, ccungccaw hae kha hopya lan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua kaw a pyapaw atyn-are athang mawlaezung, byakin thingkua a puihtu ranpibawi hae tuh Jordan vaw angaelung kya a thadyn hae. Ccungccaw hae tuh rangsakute vaw a zua hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae balyn a zua kou hae te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua te ranpibawi hae tuh ccungccaw hae malang khe a cceih hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Reuben phin hae, Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin hae angankuh kha Moses nynh a hopya hae hawte Israel hae malang khe zunghe ccyngkute a cceih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Ccungccaw thong sung pali loukaw tuh rhawtuk nawlan zunghe ccyngkute Jeriko bialae langkhe rhawtuk lan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuin nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua kha Israel hae balyn malang khe a hangthung; minmin nynh Moses kha saw a tua hae hawte, Joshua kha a she lungkhu balyn saw a tua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua kha, <verse number="16" style="v" />“Byakin thingkua a puihtu ranpibawi hae kha Jordan vaw kyate pou lan kawpya hae,” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Joshua nynh ranpibawi hae kha, “Jordan vaw kyate oun pou oh,” cite kaw a pya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua a puihtu ranpibawi hae tuh Jordan vaw angaelung kyate pou hae zah, ranpibawi hae ccuphe nynh laerou kha he a sy te, Jordan vaw tuh a luamae hawte luathui zah, Jordan vaw tuh atakaw lya hawte varang lang balyn aleikuh vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae tuh masaty sawpaw, nin haw nin khe Jordan vaw kyate pou hae zah, Jeriko nithua lang ramri, Gilgal kya a rya hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Jordan vawkhu e a law hae paw lung ccanghaw lae ning kha Joshua nynh Gilgal kya bing zah, <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel hae kha, “Nyalang ccyh kya nae ccaaw hae nynh mih paaw hae kha, ‘E lung hae hynh paw suilan mou athua?’ cite a khia hae ze, <verse number="22" style="v" />nae ccaaw hae kha, ‘Israel hae nynh Jordan vaw hynh laerou kyate a la zua hae,’ cite na nysah cih oh. <verse number="23" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh khuraw lang ah zua kou makhia oh, Rili Se kha oun rousahpya hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh Jordan vaw kha na zua kou makhia oh, nae hanlan a rousah, <verse number="24" style="v" />laephi vaw e ccungccaw hae balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih tuh athung cipaw a ny nawlan hae te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha zungzae na ri nawlan oh nynh thua,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Gilgal kya Vingdungawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel hae nynh Jordan vaw a zua kou makhia hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jordan vaw e tui tuh a rousahpya hae cipaw kha Jordan khuraw niccaw lang umpaw Amor hae siapharan hae balyn te rili pe umpaw Kanaan hae siapharan hae balyn nynh he a thae hae tuh, Israel hae keiccu rih hae zah mih rawthungnaw phe zo vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua kha, “Rihlung ccezung hae kha rae lah, Israel hae tuh vae ningnaw vingdungaw hae,” a cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Joshua nynh rihlung ccezung hae tuh rae zah, Gibeath-haaraloth<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Vingdung Mua” cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> kyakhe Israel hae kha vingdung a aw hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawkeiccumou Joshua nynh Israel hae tuh vingdung a aw hae ci ze: Izip ram te a pou hae paw pise hae balyn, rhawkaw hae balyn tuh Izip kyate a pou kou hae te, ramkaw laanryng kya phe chih vae hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Izip ram kyate oun pou hae paw balyn tuh vingdungaw vae paw a la thua hae zemah, Izip ram kyate a pou kou hae te, ramkaw laanryng kya a pui hae paw balyn tuh vingdungaw thua loh khyh hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawccecize Izip ram kyate a pou hae paw minphuin pynpi, rhawkaw hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha ngae khyh hae zah a chi mawlaezung hae, Israel hae tuh ramkaw kya kum sung pali a cceih hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minpaaw hae kyaze kae pya cih oh cite bya a kinpyaku hae paw ram, mateitui te khoilutui aluanaw ram kha minmin nynh muih lei lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thya a law hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:28-35">Nam 14.28-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh-e ccungccaw hae ccelang a puisah hae paw mih ccaaw hae kha Joshua nynh vingdung a aw hae; pawccecize minmin tuh laanryng kya vingdungaw thua loh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mih minphuin pynpi te vingdung a awkuh kou hae te, phe a dan hae cia ryahmin lungkhu mih umnaw kya a um hae. <verse number="9" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua kyakhe, “Izip ram e saryanaw kha nae kyate atunin ka vua vae,” a ci. Tukeiccuze tuh-e hmin tuh Gilgal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">gilgal: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh Hebru bya te “vua” cite hopaw roi te alokuh.</char></note> cite atunin cia ko athua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Gilgal kya Kawtaw Poi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Israel hae nynh Gilgal kya a rya lya hae, tuh-e sawpaw nin haw lae pali nin zete khe Jeriko bialae kya kawtaw poi a tua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-13">Exo 12.1-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Kawtaw poi koute awkhualan, tuin nin ccaccei khe ram kyate apoupaw, ransi phing leipaw sanlou te thoupaw ccathae kha a ae hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Ram kyate apoupaw looh a ae nin hae khe manna tuh phe thang zah Israel hae nynh manna kha hoi vae khyh hae; tuin kum kyakhe Kanaan ram kyate apoupaw looh kha a ae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:35">Exo 16.35</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Joshua Vizin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Joshua tuh Jeriko khua pe a um lyakhe, ngawdo zah ccungccapaw lu kheit thaloi thuaakute a malang phang a thadynpaw kha a muih. Joshua nynh a kalan ccianua zah, “Nang hynh kaening kalan na panpaw tou? Tuhkhyhze kae rhaw hae kalan na panpaw tou?” cite a khia. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuh-e paw nynh, “Thua khyh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rhawkaw hae kya-e rhawbawi lante atu kae thua vae,” a cipya. Te Joshua nynh laekhu kya bakhungte beik zah, “Ka Bawipaw, na ryalahtu kae hynh pawmou nae naw ry?” a ci. <verse number="15" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rhawkaw hae kya-e rhawbawipaw nynh Joshua kha, “Na phanah kha khahkuh; pawccecize na thadynnaw hmin tuh athyaapaw nynh thua,” a cipya. Te Joshua nynh a hopya thyhte a cyi.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jeriko Lawnaw te Ronaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel hae keiccuze Jeriko khua tuh alungkhu lang te thuasah, atolang te thuasah phang a khaw hae; tukeiccuze a poupaw te a teepaw humhung mah um khyh. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua kha, “Dotua, Jeriko khua tuh a siapharan te a rhawkaw hae ryte na kuih kya kae pya vae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Khua kha na voilu cih oh, rhawkaw balyn nynh se kheit a voilu cih hae, tuhcite nin taruh lungkhu na cyih cih oh, <verse number="4" style="v" />ranpibawi lu sari nynh byakin thingkua malang khe tuutepaw ki mungkae ccangsari kha a ccyngkuh cih hae. Nin sarinaw nin vae tuh khua kha vae sari na voilu cih oh, ranpibawi hae nynh mungkae kha a tu cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin nynh tuutepaw ki kha tu hae zah, mungkae roi kha he na thae oh te, ccungccaw balyn nynh thawmawte a sia cih hae; te khua koihnawpaw khualungrua tuh marya a ting cih zah, ccungccaw hae balyn tuh lawbabin lan malang a cceih cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Nun ccapaw Joshua nynh ranpibawi hae kha ko hae zah, “Byakin thingkua kha lah oh lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua malang khe ranpibawi lu sari nynh tuutepaw ki ccangsari kha ccyng oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae balyn kha mah, “Malang cceih oh lah, khuapi kha voilu oh, zunghe a ccyngkuh hae paw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua malang cceih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Joshua nynh ccungccaw hae tuh kaw a pya hae thyhte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang kya tuutepaw ki mungkae ccangsari a ccyngtu hae ranpibawi lu sari tuh mungkae tu biate malang cceih hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua nynh minmin kha a zui hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te zunghe ccyngkuh hae paw tuh mungkae tu hae paw ranpibawi hae malang a cceih hae; mungkae a tu cciamang lya hae khe, nulang rhawviatu hae nynh byakin thingkua kha a zuibia hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Joshua nynh ccungccaw hae kha, “Sia oh kae cipya makhia oh, na sia lan khyh oh, nae roi mah na ccaesah lan khyh oh, bya kaw kheit san na ho lan khyh oh. Tukoute na sia cih oh,” cite kaw a pya hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua nynh khua kha se kheit a voilu; te ryahmin langkhe cceih hae zah tuh-e khuazi tuh ryahmin kya a rya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Te Joshua tuh awkhua takaw te tho zah, ranpibawi hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua kha a puih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua malang khe ranpibawi lu sari tuh tuutepaw ki mungkae ccangsari kha ccyng hae zah tu biate a cceih hae. Zunghe ccyngkuh hae paw tuh minmin malang cceih hae zah, nulang rhawviatu hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua nulang te a cceih hae, ranpibawi hae nynh mungkae kha a tubia lalia hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Nin ningnaw nin khe khua kha se kheit a voilu kou hae te, ryahmin lang a ki hae. Tuhcite nin taruh lungkhu a cyi hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nin sarinaw nin khuadaetakaw vyvy aw te tho hae zah, a cyimae hae hawte khua tuh se sari a voilu hae; tuh-e nin rou nynh khua tuh se sari a voilu hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te se sarinaw vae tuh, ranpibawi nynh mungkae he a tu te, Joshua nynh ccungccaw hae kha, “Sia oh! Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh khua tuh ae pya vae oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Khua te a lungkhu umpaw balyn tuh ro khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan pya athua cih. Aening nynh ah saw oh paw locceihtu hae kha a thuruh keiccu hae ze, ohhuanung Rahab te a inn kya um hae paw balyn tuh a hiin cih hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ro lan cite pya vae paw uccaw hae kha nanning nynh lah nan oh, ro lan pya vae paw uccaw ccangkhakheit kha na lawsei oh zetuh, Israel tungvaw vawsawnaw thuakhaete Israel ryahmin kha ro lanpaw uccaw lang na raesei cih oh. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama sui te ngun, sohin te sivaw uccaw hae balyn tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan thyaasah athua cih hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> sisuainn lungkhu lang a tee cih hae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw hae tuh sia hae zah mungkae kha a tu hae. Ccungccaw hae nynh mungkae roi kha he a thae takaw hae te, thawte sia hae zah khualungrua tuh marya a ting; tukeiccuze ccungccaw hae tuh khua lungkhu lang lawbabin lan tee hae zah khua kha a law hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:30">Heb 11.30</ref></char></note> <verse number="21" style="v" />Te khua kya umpaw balyn, nopi pise, adih ale, vaetua, tuu te lann hae kha thaloi te marya a ro hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh ram dophitu lu ning hae kyakhe, “Ohhuanung inn lang la tee oh lah, bya na kinpyaku oh hawte, tuh-e nopinung te a ccungccaw hae balyn kha oun poukhae oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze dophitu athua hae paw ccangvae hae nynh tee hae zah Rahab kha a nung, a paaw, a raee hae te a ccungccaw hae balyn—a puizia hae balyn ryte poukhae hae zah, Israel ryahmin atolang khe a nung hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Khua te a lungkhu umpaw atyn-are kha maee te a soi hae, sui te ngun, sohin te sivaw uccaw hae rou kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya umpaw sisuainn lungkhu lang a nung hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuasalama ohhuanung Rahab tuh a innbyn hae te a ccungccaw hae balyn ryte Joshua nynh chia leite a haang hae. A ciihan hae tuh Israel hae kya atunin cia a um hae. Pawccecize Joshua nynh Jeriko khua dophi khylan a saw hae paw locceihtu hae kha Rahab nynh a thuruh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:31">Heb 11.31</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tetuh Joshua nynh thyalawkute,</para>
  <para style="q1">“E Jeriko khua hynh raethui lan</para>
  <para style="q2">a zuakuhpaw miakaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang thyalaw thua sah!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:34">1Si 16.34</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">A ccatawccaw lu khate</para>
  <para style="q1">khua athonaw aleihpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a thadynsah cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccasoi lu khate khua koikua kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a rae cih!” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Joshua kya um zah, ram pynpi kya a min tuh athaan.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Akhan Seinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thuasalama pya vae paw uccaw kyakhe Israel hae tuh lungzinaw hoi khyh hae: Judah phin hae kya-e Zerah ccapaw Zabdi ccapaw Karmi ccapaw Akhan nynh pya vae paw uccaw abang kha a law; te Israel hae tungvaw kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh maee lang arua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Joshua nynh Jeriko kyate Bethel nithua lang, Beth-aven pe umpaw Ai khua langkhe ccungccaw hae kha saw hae zah, “La cceihthung oh lah, ram kha la dophitua oh,” a cipya hae. Te ccungccaw hae nynh cceihthung hae zah, Ai khua kha a dophi hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te Joshua kalan ki hae zah, “Ccungccaw balynte cciathung ho lan khyh; milu thong ning thong thum loukaw maw te cceih hae sah lah, Ai kha la tuk hae sah. Minmin tuh eih azya hae keiccuze ccungccaw balynte mih thawbangsah nan hae,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw thong thum han tuh cceihthung hae zah, Ai khua e ccungccaw hae malang khe a ccue vae hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Ai khua e ccungccaw hae nynh sung thum lu taruh a chia hae, khua koikua atolang te Shebarim kyacia dee hae zah hary apannaw kyakhe a chia hae. Te ccungccaw hae balyn tuh myarya rih hae zah mih rawthungnaw phe zo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tetuh Joshua nynh a boeining kha seii zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua malang khe Israel piccan hae ryte zete cia laekhu kya a bakhung hae; mih lu kya vuiping a phingku hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh, “Ezou, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia! Kaening hynh Amor hae kuih kya pyate ro khylan, pawccemou e ccungccaw hae hynh Jordan khuraw lang na zuakhae hae? Jordan khuraw kya khuasah lan kha kae lung la ccingkhaekuh sah lah ze! <verse number="8" style="v" />Pou Bawipaw, Israel hae nynh mih rhaw hae malang te nulang ki vae hae zah, pawmou ka ho kho vae cih! <verse number="9" style="v" />Kanaan hae te e ram kya um hae paw balyn nynh a thae cih hae zah kaening hynh oun koihlu cih hae, kae min hynh laephi kyate a zosah vae cih hae. Tetuh alesaepaw na min hanlan pawtemou na cyih vae cih?” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua kha, “Thoku tua! Pawccemou na bakhung? <verse number="11" style="v" />Israel nynh phe sei vae; kaw ka pya hae paw ka byakin kha phe ro vae hae. Pya vae paw uccaw abang kha phe law hae; ruh hae zah hynbya hote mih uccaw hae kya a nungbia hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel hae tuh mih rhaw hae malang thadyn kho khyh hae; mimaw toulou kha ro lanpaw uccaw lang a tansaku hae keiccuze mih rhaw hae malang khe nulang a maeleihkuh hae. Pya vae paw uccaw hae kha nae kyate na ro khyh oh zetuh, nae kya ka um vae lan khyh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thoku tua, ccungccaw hae kha thyaasah hae lah, ‘Awkhualan hanlan thyaasakuh oh, pawccecize Israel Pachia <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Pou Israel, pya vae paw uccaw hae tuh nae kya a um; tuh-e pya vae paw uccaw hae kha nae kyate ccaring na vua mawlaezung oh, nae rhaw hae malang na thadyn kho lan khyh oh,” a ci. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze awkhualan awkhua tuh phin kheit koute phin kheit malang na cceih cih oh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a popaw phin tuh puizia hae thyhte na naekuh cih oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a popaw puizia tuh innbyn thyhte na naekuh cih oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a popaw innbyn tuh lu kheit ccite na naekuh cih oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te pya vae paw uccaw hae a lahtupaw tuh a hoipaw uccaw hae balyn ryte maee te soi athua cih, pawccecize aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakinnaw kha ei zah Israel hae kya maethya lan umpaw kha a cyi vae,’ cite hopah hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Joshua tuh awkhua takaw te tho zah Israel hae kha phin kheit koute phin kheit cciakhae hae zah, Judah phin tuh law athua. <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah phin kha cciakhae hae zah, Zerah puizia hae tuh law athua; te Zerah puizia hae tuh innbyn byn kheit koute byn kheit cciakhae hae zah Zabdi innbyn tuh law athua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te Zabdi innbyn kha lu raveihte cciakhae hae zah Judah phin kya-e Zerah ccapaw Zabdi, Zabdi ccapaw Karmi, Karmi ccapaw Akhan tuh law athua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tetuh Joshua nynh Akhan kha, “Ka ccapaw, Israel Pachia <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha phu-esah lah, amaw malang na seinaw kha phyku tua. Na cyipaw kha atu yn hopya tua; yn phei nan,” a cipya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Akhan nynh Joshua kha, “Athua, Israel Pachia <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw a seipaw tuh kamaw hynh nynh ka thua. Ka cyipaw tuh hynhte nynh thua: <verse number="21" style="v" />luadepaw uccaw hae kyakhe apuithyapaw Babilon angkiccua, ngun shekel za ning te shekel sung pangaw aripaw suitung tung kheit kha he ka muih tuh, eih ka duaa zah ka lawku. Tuh-e hae tuh ka bu lungkhu lae kaw kya nynh ka thuruh, ngun tuh akawkou nynh a um,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Joshua nynh locceihtu hae kha saw hae zah, tuh-e hae tuh bu kalan a ccue hae; a bu kyatuin a thuruhpaw tuh-e uccaw hae tuh la um zah ngun tuh akawkou a la um. <verse number="23" style="v" />Bu kya-e kha lah hae zah Joshua te Israel hae kalan a cciakhae hae; te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe a nung hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te Joshua te Israel hae balyn nynh Zerah ccapaw Akhan kha ngun, angkiccua, suitung, a ccapaw hae te a ccanung hae, a tangnua hae, lann hae, tuu hae, a bu te a hoipaw uccaw hae balyn ryte cciakhae hae zah Akhor Accya langkhe a thuakhae hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Joshua nynh, “Pawccemou kae tungvaw vawsawnaw na thuasah? Atunin <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh na tungvaw vawsawnaw a thuasah cih,” a ci. Te Israel hae balyn nynh Akhan tuh lung te phe chih lan a deih hae; minmin kha lung te deih hae zah maee te a u hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Aning kha lung patae pumthin hae zah tuh-e tuh atunin cia a um ung. Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh maee lang ruapaw a thinrianaw kha a daesah vae. Tukeiccuze tuh-e hmin tuh atunin cia Akhor<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“Vawsawnaw” cipaw nynh thua.</char></note> Accya a ci hae.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ai Khua Taenaw te Ronaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua kha, “Rih nan, na lungroh nan sah; rhawkaw balyn kha ko hae lah, namaw ryte Ai khua lang cceihthung oh. Ai siapharan kha a khua, a ccungccaw hae te a ram ryte na kuih kya kae pya vae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Jeriko khua te a siapharan tungvaw na cyi hawte, Ai khua te a siapharan tungvaw na cyih cih; luadepaw uccaw te a sahiin-awvaw kyalya kha naemaw hanlan na lawkuh cih oh; khua kha anulang te buhkhaw oh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Joshua te rhawkaw balyn tuh Ai lang ccia lan a thokuh hae. Joshua nynh arawthungpaw rhawkaw thong sung thum kha pote, khuazi khe kawpyate cciasah hae zah, <verse number="4" style="v" />“Khua kha anulang te na buh cih oh; khua kyate myarya sawnaw lang cceih nan oh, nae balynte raeringkute na um cih oh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Kae te kae umkheihpaw ccungccaw hae balyn nynh khua kha kae naenuakuh cih. Minmin nynh kaening kha he oun pounua hae te, atakaw lya hawte, kae ccuetaw cih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Khua kyate asawnaw lang kae thua mawlaezung oun deehui cih hae; pawccecize minmin nynh, ‘Atakaw lya hawte oun ccuetaw vae hae,’ cite a ci cih hae. Minmin kyate kae ccue lyakhe, <verse number="7" style="v" />na buhnaw oh kyate na thokuh cih oh zah khua kha na lah cih oh; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh khua kha nae kuih kya ae pya cih oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te khua kha he na lah kou oh te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte khua tuh maee te na soi cih oh; tuhcite kaw kae pya vae oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuhcite Joshua nynh saw hae zah buhnaw hmin lang a cceih hae, Ai te Bethel laku, Ai te niccaw langkhe a um hae; tuh-e khuazi tuh Joshua tuh ryahmin kya nynh a rya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Te Joshua tuh awkhua takaw te tho zah ccungccaw hae kha a pum kou hae te, ccungccaw hae malang khe Israel piccan hae ryte Ai khua lang a cceih hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te amaw kya um hae paw rhawkaw hae balyn tuh cceihthung hae zah, khua kalan a naekuh hae, Ai te thahlang khe a rya hae, Ai te minmin laku kya vuakarung ccangkheit a um. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te pise thong pangaw kha ko hae zah, Bethel te Ai laku, khua te niccaw langkhe a buhsah hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuhcite rhawkaw hae kha nung hae zah, ryahminpi tuh khua te thahlang, nulang rhawvia hae tuh khua te niccaw langkhe a nung. Tuh-e khuazi Joshua tuh accya kya a rya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ai siapharan nynh tuh-e tuh he a muih te, amaw te a ccungccaw hae balyn te khuaccaaw hae tuh Israel hae kha tuk khylan Arabah accya lang ahawipaw tungkunaw hmin langkhe awkhua takaw te rangsakute a cceih hae; thuasalama khua nulang te oun buhkhaw hae cipaw kha nyh khyh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Joshua te Israel hae balyn tuh mih malang khe rhaw phe shung hae paw hawte umsakuh nyn hae zah, ramkaw langkhe a ccue hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze khua kya um hae paw balyn kha mimaw ryte pynkheihlan deehui khylan kokuh hae zah, Joshua kha khua te asawnaw lang cia a deehui hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ai khua te Bethel khua kya Israel hae deehui lan a cceih leipaw pise lu kheit san um khyh; khua koikua kha khawsya leite Israel hae kha a deehui hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Oute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua kha, “Na kuih kya umpaw thaloi khate Ai langkhe eetua; pawccecize Ai tuh na kuih kya kae pya cih,” a cipya. Te Joshua nynh a kuih kya umpaw thaloi khate Ai langkhe a ee. <verse number="19" style="v" />A kuih he a dyng takaw te, a buhtu rhawkaw hae nynh mih umnaw kyate arangte thokuh hae zah, malang khe a naangbia hae, khua lungkhu lang teete khua kha lah hae zah, maee te palou a soi vae hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tetuh Ai khuaccaaw hae nynh nulang he a do hae tuh, dotua, khua kya-e maeekhuh tuh vaawlui lang a kaethung vae. Minmin tuh teitei lang mah ccue khonaw thawzung hoi vae khyh hae, pawccecize ramkaw lang ccue hae paw nynh a deehuitu hae kha kinua hae zah a tuk vae hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />A buhtu hae nynh khua a law vae hae cipaw te khua kya-e maeekhuh kha Joshua te Israel hae balyn nynh he a muih hae tuh, kinua hae zah Ai khuaccaaw hae kha a chia hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Te mingccang hae nynh khua kyate pounua hae zah minmin kha a dou hae; tukeiccuze Israel hae nynh Ai hae kha voilang ranglang te varyng a koihlu hae keiccuze a hiinhypaw te a ccuepaw lu kheit san a um lei lan a chia hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama Ai siapharan tuh a hiin pite Joshua kalan a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel hae nynh Ai khuaccaaw hae kha a deehuinaw hae ramkaw khe marya theih hae zah, mih balyn mawte thaloi te a chih kou hae te, Israel hae balyn nynh Ai khua lang kinua hae zah, khua kya um hae paw kha thaloi te marya a bae hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuin nin kya a chihpaw nopi pise, Ai khuaccaaw hae mih balynte thong haw lae ning acih hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Pawccecize Joshua nynh Ai khuaccaaw hae balyn kha khaleih a ro mawlaezung hae, thaloi a eenawpaw a kuih kha khin khyh. <verse number="27" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua kha kaw a pya thyhte, tuin khua kya-e sahiin-awvaw hae te luadepaw uccaw hae kyalya kha Israel hae nynh mimaw uccaw lang a lawku hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh Ai khua kha maee te soi zah, atunin cia zungzae arohpaw apumkuhpaw lang a rae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Te Ai siapharan kha zete cia thingku kya a sae; khuanin ccah te, Joshua nynh kawpya hae zah a rhua kha thingku vaw kyate sahbung hae zah, khua koikua teenaw kin khe a vua hae, lungpum pi lang pumthin hae zah tuh-e tuh atunin cia a um.</para>
  <para style="s1">Joshua nynh Byakin A Thawsah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tetuh Joshua nynh Ebal Mua vawlan khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia, elang silawhang ccangkheit a rae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.30-32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:2-8">Deu 27.2-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu Moses nynh Israel hae kha kawpya hae zah, Moses kawbya ccauh kyaze, “a awkuh leipaw, sivawhaelua mah mangnua leipaw lung te raepaw silawhang,” cite azeiku thyhte a rae hae; tuh-e vawlan khe maee-ute silawnaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan rae hae zah, ccawkunaw silawnaw kha a rae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:25">Exo 20.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v" />Te tuin kya, Israel hae malang khe Moses nynh a zeipaw kawbya kha Joshua nynh tuh-e lung hae vawlan khe a khawpi. <verse number="33" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae nynh Israel hae kha hythua a pya cih hae, cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu Moses nynh masaty lyaze kaw a pya hae thyhte, Israel hae balyn, ramccungccaw te ramccang ccungccaw hae tuh mih piccan hae, mih bawi hae te mih byapiatu hae ryte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua puihtu Levi phin ranpibawi hae malang khe byakin thingkua te ahawiliakuh lante, ccungccaw angankuh tuh Gerizim Mua malang, tuhlaepaw angankuh tuh Ebal Mua malang khe a thadyn hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.33-35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:29">Deu 11.29</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 27:11-14">27.11-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v" />Tukoute kawbya ccauh kya azeiku thyhte, hythuanaw bya te thyalawnaw bya athuapaw kawbya kya-e bya hae balyn kha Joshua nynh a ria. <verse number="35" style="v" />Nopi hae, imua hae te mih kya umbua hae paw ramccang hae te Israel zapi hae balyn malang khe Moses nynh kaw a pyapaw bya balyn kya-e byaccan ccangkheit sanmah Joshua nynh a ria leipaw um khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Gibeon hae nynh Joshua A Ling hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jordan khuraw lang mua vaw e ram te laephi anenaw ram, Lebanon ram cia Rili Pi vahue kya po um hae paw Hit hae, Amor hae, Kanaan hae, Periz hae, Hiv hae te Jebus hae mih siapharan hae balyn nynh e kong a thae hae tuh, <verse number="2" style="v" />Joshua te Israel kha dou khylan lunglokute pynkheihlan a pumkuh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama Joshua nynh Jeriko khua te Ai khua kya a cyipaw kha Gibeon khuaccaaw hae nynh he a thae hae tuh, <verse number="4" style="v" />thyaruhhahi lante rya a law hae: cceih hae zah vaelooh kha a paccynku hae, mih lann hae hanlan aseiikuhpaw sungkua kha mang hae zah, apuepaw, aseiikuhpaw te abiakuhpaw misutui-saphuabawng kha a phusah hae, <verse number="5" style="v" />pae zah bia vae paw phanah kha nahkuh hae zah boeining puesalaepaw kha a lawku hae; te mih vaelooh balyn tuh rou zah amua vae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Gilgal khua ryahmin kya um hae paw Joshua te Israel hae kalan cceih hae zah, “Laansawpi umpaw ram kyate nynh kae thua; tukeiccuze kaening ryte byakinnaw rae oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama Israel hae nynh Hiv hae kha, “Nanning hynh kaening laku kya um hae paw mah poh na thua kho oh, pawtemou nanning te byakinnaw ah rae kho cih oh?” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:32">Exo 23.32</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 34:12">34.12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:2">Deu 7.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Minmin nynh Joshua kha, “Kaening tuh na ryalahtu hae nynh kae thua,” a cipya hae. Te Joshua nynh minmin kha, “Hum hae mou na thua oh? Paw kyate mou nae thua oh?” a cipya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te minmin nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia min keiccuze laansawpi e ram kyate nynh kae thua; pawccecize Pachia kong kha thuasah, Izip ram kya a cyipaw balyn kha thuasah, <verse number="10" style="v" />Jordan khuraw lang um hae paw Amor hae siapharan lu ning, Heshbon siapharan Sihon te Ashroth kya umpaw Bashan siapharan Og tungvaw a cyipaw balyn kha thuasah kae thae vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Nam 21.21-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae piccan hae te kae ram e ccungccaw hae balyn nynh kaening kha, ‘Laanryng kya ae lanpaw vaelooh phukute la cceih oh, minmin kha la tungkuh oh lah, “Kaening tuh nae ryalahtu hae nynh kae thua; atu kaening te byakinnaw rae oh,” cite la hopah oh,’ oun cipya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Vaelooh lang kae phukupaw sanlou tuh hein kya a um; laanryng hanlan kae phukupaw kae sanlou hae hynh kae inn kyate nae kalan ccia lan kae thoku nin tuh sokaleihpaw nynh thua, thuasalama atu tuh dotua oh, rou zah phe mua vae. <verse number="13" style="v" />E misutui-saphuabawng hae hynh mah kae ruin takaw lya tuh athawpaw athua zemah, dotua oh, phe paw vae; te e kae boeining hae te kae phanah hae hynh mah kae laanccia eih saw keiccu pue zah apae vae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze cciakhaetu piccan hae nynh mih vaelooh kha ae hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuanaw kha ngiakuh khyh hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh minmin ryte ccawkunaw rae zah, mih hiinnaw haang lante aamah a khanpyaku hae; te ccungccaw zapi cciakhaetu hae nynh minmin kha thyalawkute bya a kinpyaku hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Minmin ryte byakinnaw a rae kou hae te nin thum he aro te, Gibeon hae tuh mih innpaw hae thua hae zah mimaw kya a um hae paw nynh thua cipaw kha a ny hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Israel hae nynh cceih hae zah nin thum te mih khua a thua hae. Mih khua hae tuh Gibeon, Khefirah, Beeroth te Kiriath-jearim nynh thua hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia liate ccungccaw zapi cciakhaetu hae nynh bya a kinpyaku vae hae keiccuze Israel hae nynh minmin kha tuk khyh hae. Te ccungccaw zapi balyn nynh cciakhaetu hae kha a seisah hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama cciakhaetu hae nynh ccungccaw zapi hae balyn kyakhe, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia min te kaening nynh minmin kha bya kae kinpyaku vae hae keiccuze minmin kha ty lei lan vae hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Mih tungvaw kya aening nynh hynhte cyi lan: Aening nynh minmin kha thyalawkute bya ah kinpyaku vae oh keiccuze ah tungvaw kya thin-unaw accaw khyh nawlan, mih hiinnaw kha haang lan hae,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Cciakhaetu hae nynh, “Minmin tuh hiin ccaleih hae sah,” a ci hae. Tuhcite cciakhaetu hae nynh minmin konglang bya a pae vae hae hawte, minmin tuh zapi hae hanlan maeething tyatu lang te tui thetu lang a tang hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joshua nynh minmin kha ko hae zah, “Kae kya mang na um oh pite, ‘Nae kyate laansawpi kya a um hae paw nynh kae thua,’ cite pawccemou nae ling oh? <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nanning tuh thyalaw na thua vae oh zah, abang tuh see lang zungzae na tang cih oh, ka Pachia inn hanlan tui thetu te maeething tyatu na thua cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Minmin nynh Joshua kha, “Ram hae balyn hynh nanning pya lan zah, ram kya um hae paw balyn hynh nae malang ro lanpaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh a ryalahtu Moses kya kaw a pya vae cipaw kha na ryalahtu hae kaening kya phe ria lan oun hopah hae zah, nanning keiccuze kae hiinnaw hanlan myarya kae ri pawte, hynh-e uccaw hynh kae cyi. <verse number="25" style="v" />Atu kaening hynh na kuih kya nynh kae um: kae tungvaw kya cyi lan ahoy ahme cite na tua thyhte cyih ccaleih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Joshua nynh minmin hanlan kha hynhte a cyi: minmin kha Israel hae kyate khum hae zah theih khyh hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Thuasalama tuin nin khe Joshua nynh minmin kha ccungccaw zapi elang thuasah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a po cih paw hmin kya rae lanpaw silawhang elang thuasah atunin cia maeething tyatu lang te tui thetu lang a nung hae.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Khuanin A Thadyn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joshua nynh Jeriko khua te a siapharan tungvaw a cyi hawte, pawtemou Ai khua kha lah zah, Ai khua te a siapharan kha marya a ro cipaw kha thuasah, pawtemou Gibeon khuaccaaw hae nynh Israel hae ryte ccawkunaw rae hae zah minmin kya a umbua hae cipaw kha thuasah, Jerusalem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jerusalem: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">khua hynh tuh ccyh lya tuh Jebus hae khuapi nynh thua.</char></note> siapharan Adonizedek nynh he a thae tuh, <verse number="2" style="v" />myarya a rih, pawccecize Gibeon tuh siapharan khua khuakheit hawte khua lepaw thua zah Ai khua laeze mah alehua, khua kya-e pise hae balyn tuh arawthungpaw ccungccaw hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jerusalem siapharan Adonizedek nynh Hebron siapharan Hoham, Jarmuth siapharan Piram, Lakhish siapharan Jafia te Eglon siapharan Debir kha byataw hae zah, <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka kalan oun cceih oh lah, yn bawm oh, Gibeon kha tuk oh sih; pawccecize aning nynh Joshua te Israel hae ryte ccawkunaw a rae vae hae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh Amor hae siapharan lu pangaw—Jerusalem siapharan, Hebron siapharan, Jarmuth siapharan, Lakhish siapharan te Eglon siapharan hae nynh—mih rhawkaw hae kha pum hae zah mih rhawkaw hae balyn ryte Gibeon khua kha ryahmin tahnuakute a tuk hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Gibeon hae nynh Gilgal ryahmin kya umpaw Joshua kalan ccungccaw saw hae zah, “Na ryalahtu kaening hynh oun vua nan; arangte beih yn cceihthung, oun bawmtua lah oun khumtua; pawccecize mua vaw kya khuasah hae paw Amor hae siapharan balyn nynh oun pumnuaku vae hae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Joshua tuh rhawkaw hae balyn, athungpaw mih rawhoy hae paw balyn ryte Gilgal kyate a cceihthung hae. <verse number="8" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua kyakhe, “Minmin kha rih nan hae, pawccecize minmin kha na kuih kya kae pya vae; na malang lu kheit san thadyn kho lan khyh hae,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Joshua tuh Gilgal kyate zidae cceihthung zah, vaekheitmawte a tuk hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha Israel hae malang siisakute ccuesah hae zah, Gibeon kyakhe patae a chia hae, Beth-horon khua te cciathungnaw laanpi kalan khe dee hae zah Azekah te Makkedah khua kyacia po a chia hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te Israel hae malang ccue hae zah, Beth-horon khua hary apannaw kya a cciabung lya hae khe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Azekah khua cia vaawlang te lungtungpi sawphu hae zah a chih hae; Israel hae nynh thaloi te a chia hae paw laeze hya keiccuze a chih hae paw tuh alunghua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Amor hae kha Israel hae kya a pya nin hae khe, Joshua nynh Israel hae muihnaw kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha hynhte a hopya,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Khuanin, Gibeon khua kya</para>
  <para style="q2">phang thadyntua,</para>
  <para style="q1">Sawpaw, Aijalon accya kya</para>
  <para style="q2">phang thadyntua,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel hae nynh mih rhaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phu a lawru makhia hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">khuanin tuh tyty um zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">sawpaw tuh a thadyn.</para>
  <para style="m">E hynh Jashar ccauh kya azeikuh khaw? Khuanin tuh vaawlui ngaelung kya thadyn zah, nin kheit loukaw ccaw leite a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:18">2Sa 1.18</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuin nin hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ccungccaw bya a ngaepya nin tuh um boi khyh zah malang ccyh kya mah um vae khyh; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae elang rhaw a tukpya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukoute Joshua te Israel hae tuh Gilgal umpaw mih ryahmin lang a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Siapharan Lu Pangaw Taenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />E siapharan lu pangaw hae tuh ccue hae zah Makkedah lungkarung kya a rekuh hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />“Makkedah lungkarung kya a rekuh hae paw siapharan lu pangaw hae kha muih athua vae hae,” cite Joshua kha a hopya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Joshua nynh, “Lungkarung akhu rae kalan khe lungtungpi hae kha tounua oh lah, a pepan kya minmin a ngawtu hae kha nung oh; <verse number="19" style="v" />thuasalama naemaw tuh tuin kya um nan oh; nae rhaw hae kha deehui oh lah, mih nulang te tuk oh. Mih khua lang teesah nan oh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh minmin kha nae kuih kya ae pya vae oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Joshua te Israel hae nynh minmin kha a thang makhia hae cia, patae a theih kou hae te, te a hiinhy hae paw tuh akoihkuhpaw khua lungkhu lang he a tee hae te, <verse number="21" style="v" />ccungccaw hae balyn tuh Makkedah ryahmin kya umpaw Joshua kalan khe khyndadyh lan a ki hae; humhung nynh mah Israel ccungccaw lukhakheit kha rawsete byakhung ngan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh, “Lungkarung akhu kha hung oh lah, siapharan lu pangaw hae kha lungkarung kyate ka kalan oun poukhae oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhcite cyih hae zah, Jerusalem siapharan, Hebron siapharan, Jarmuth siapharan, Lakhish siapharan te Eglon siapharan, tuh-e siapharan lu pangaw hae tuh lungkarung kyate amaw kalan a poukhae hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te tuh-e siapharan hae kha Joshua kya a thuakhae hae tuh, Joshua nynh Israel hae balyn kha ko hae zah, amaw ryte a cceihkheih hae paw rhawbawi hae kyakhe, “Oun naekuh oh lah, e siapharan hae nging kyahin nae ccu kha khang oh,” a cipya hae. Tetuh minmin nynh naekuh hae zah mih ccu kha siapharan hae nging kya a khang hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh minmin kha, “Rih nan oh, nae bungzou nan sah; nae thawsaesakuh oh lah, nae rawthungsakuh oh; pawccecize na tuk oh paw rhaw hae balyn tungvaw kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhcite a cyih cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tukoute Joshua nynh bua hae zah a chia hae, te thingku ku pangaw kya a sae hae. Zete cia thingku kya a sae hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Khuanin yn ccah te, Joshua nynh kawpya hae zah, thingku kyate sahbung hae zah a rekunaw hae lungkarung kalan a vua hae, lungkarung khurae kyakhe lungtungpi hae kha a nungkhaw hae, tuh-e tuh atunin cia a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Joshua nynh Makkedah khua kha lah zah, tuh-e khua te a siapharan kha thaloi te a bae hae; khua lungkhu umpaw ccungccaw balyn kha lu kheit san a laehy lei lan ciate khaleih a ro hae. Jeriko siapharan tungvaw a cyi hawte Makkedah siapharan tungvaw kya mah a cyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Te Joshua tuh Israel hae balyn ryte Makkedah kyate Libnah lang po sulue hae zah Libnah khua kha a tuk hae. <verse number="30" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Libnah khua te mih siapharan kha mah Israel hae kuih kya a pya hae; tuh-e khua kha thaloi te bae zah, khua lungkhu umpaw ccungccaw balyn kha lu kheit san a laehy lei lan a bae hae; Jeriko siapharan tungvaw a cyi hawte Libnah siapharan tungvaw kya mah a cyi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Joshua tuh Israel ccungccaw hae ryte Libnah kyate Lakhish khua lang cceih hae zah, khua kha koihlute a tuk hae. <verse number="32" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Lakhish khua tuh Israel hae kuih kya a pya hae, nin ningnaw nin khe khua kha lah zah, Libnah khua kya a cyi hawte, khua lungkhu umpaw ccungccaw balyn kha thaloi te a bae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Te Gezer siapharan Horam tuh Lakhish khua kha bawm lan yn cceih; Joshua nynh Horam te a ccungccaw hae kha ahiinpaw lu kheit san um lei lan a chia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Joshua tuh Israel hae balyn ryte Lakhish kyate Eglon lang sulue hae zah, khua kha koihlute a tuk hae; <verse number="35" style="v" />tuin nin khe khua tuh lah hae zah thaloi te a bae hae, Lakhish tungvaw kya a cyi hawte, tuin nin khe khua lungkhu umpaw ccungccaw balyn kha khaleih a ro hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tukoute Joshua tuh Israel hae balyn ryte Eglon kyate Hebron khua langkhe cceihthung hae zah a tuk hae; <verse number="37" style="v" />Hebron kha lah hae zah mih siapharan te khua pepan e khua hae te tuin khua kya umpaw ccungccaw balyn kha thaloi te a bae hae; Eglon tungvaw a cyi hawte, lu kheit san haang leite bae hae zah, khua lungkhu umpaw ccungccaw balyn kha khaleih a ro hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Te Joshua tuh Israel hae balyn ryte Debir langkhe ki hae zah a tuk hae, <verse number="39" style="v" />Debir siapharan te a pepan e khua hae balyn kha a law hae; minmin kha thaloi te bae hae zah, khua lungkhu umpaw ccungccaw balyn kha lu kheit san a laehy lei lan khaleih a ro hae; Hebron tungvaw a cyi hawte thuasah, Libnah te mih siapharan tungvaw a cyi hawte thuasah Debir te mih siapharan tungvaw kya mah a cyi hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tuhcite Joshua nynh ram pynpi kha thuasah, muaram te Negeb ram kha thuasah, laephi anenaw ram te laephi hary apannaw ram hae te mih siapharan hae balyn kha thuasah a tae hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh kaw a pya thyhte, lu kheit san a laehy lei lan, ahysuepaw balyn kha khaleih a ro hae. <verse number="41" style="v" />Joshua nynh minmin kha Kadesh-barnea kyate Gaza kyacia, Goshen ram abalynte Gibeon khua kyacia a tae hae. <verse number="42" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh Israel hae hanlan rhaw a tuk keiccuze, Joshua nynh hynh-e siapharan hae balyn te mih ram kha vae kheit te marya a law hae. <verse number="43" style="v" />Te Joshua tuh Israel hae balyn ryte Gilgal umpaw ryahmin langkhe a ki hae.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Thahlang e Kanaan Siapharan hae kha Taenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E konglang hynh Hazor siapharan Jabin nynh he a thae tuh, Madon siapharan Jobab, Shimron siapharan, Akhshaf siapharan, <verse number="2" style="v" />thahlang muaram kya um hae paw siapharan hae, Khinneroth alia lang e Arabah kya um hae paw siapharan hae, laelung anenaw um hae paw siapharan hae, niccaw lang e Nafoth-dor kya um hae paw siapharan hae, <verse number="3" style="v" />nithua lang te niccaw lang um hae paw Kanaan hae, muaram kya um hae paw Amor hae, Hit hae, Periz hae, Jebus hae, Mizpah ram Hermon mua kaw kya um hae paw Hiv hae kha bya a taw hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e siapharan hae tuh, milu lante rili kin e laesia zeih cih hae paw mih rhawkaw hae balyn te myarya lungpaw marang hae te marangle hae ryte oun pou hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />E siapharan hae balyn nynh mih rhawkaw hae kha sueluate oun cceih hae zah, Israel hae kha dou khylan Merom tuili pe khe pynkheihlan a rya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua kyakhe, “Minmin kha rih nan hae, pawccecize awkhualan atu ccyh kya mih balynte phe chiate Israel hae kya ka pya cih hae; mih marang hae kha mih ccukantho na bae cih oh zah, mih marangle hae kha maee te na soi cih oh,” a cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Joshua nynh a rhawkaw hae balyn ryte Merom tuili pe khe vaekheihmawte thuanua hae zah a tuk hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha Israel hae kuih kya a pya hae, minmin kha tuk hae zah Sidon Lepaw te Misrefoth-maim kyacia, te nithua lang Mizpah accya kyacia a deehui hae. Lu kheit san hiin leite a chia hae. <verse number="9" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaw a pya thyhte Joshua nynh mih tungvaw a cyi; mih marang hae ccukantho kha bae zah, mih marangle hae kha maee te a soi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Joshua nynh nulang ki zah Hazor khua kha a law, te mih siapharan kha thaloi te a chia. Tuh-e ccyh maw lyaze Hazor tuh tuh-e peenaw hae balyn kya lu nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Hazor khua kya um hae paw balyn kha thaloi te bae hae zah khaleih a chia hae; ahiinpaw lu kheit san um khyh, Hazor khua kha maee te phe a soi. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu Moses nynh kaw a pya thyhte, tuh-e siapharan hae kya-e khua hae balyn te mih siapharan hae kha Joshua nynh a law hae, thaloi te theih hae zah khaleih a ro hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama Joshua nynh maee te a soipaw Hazor khua laelan, mua vawlan umpaw khua hae kha tuh Israel hae nynh maee te soi khyh hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />E khua hae kya-e luadepaw uccaw hae balyn te sahiin-awvaw hae kha Israel hae nynh mimaw elang a lawku hae; thuasalama ccungccaw hae balyn kha tuh a chi kou makhia hae, thaloi te theih hae zah ahiinpaw lu kheit san um lei lan marya a chia hae. <verse number="15" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ryalahtu Moses kha kaw a pya thyhte, Moses nynh Joshua kha kawpya pathy zah, Joshua nynh tuhcite a cyi; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kya kaw a pyapaw balyn kha a cyi leipaw um khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Joshua nynh Ram Marya A Tae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuhcite Joshua nynh tuh-e ram hae balyn kha a law: muaram, Negeb hae balyn, Goshen ram hae balyn, laelung anenaw, Arabah, Israel kya-e muaram te laelung anenaw ram, <verse number="17" style="v" />Seir lang a kaethungpaw Halah Mua kyate Hermon Mua kaw e Lebanon accya kya umpaw Baal-gad kyacia a law hae. Te Joshua nynh mih siapharan hae balyn kha a kyng hae, te tuk hae zah a chia hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Joshua tuh tuh-e siapharan hae ryte khaw cia rhaw a tukkuh hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Gibeon khua kya um hae paw Hiv hae holeite, Israel hae ryte daenaw a rae hae paw khua khuakheit san um khyh; khua abalyn mawte tuk hae zah a law hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kha kaw a la pya thyhte, tuh-e minphuin hae kha thawcci leite khaleih ro athua nawlan hae, Israel hae kha tuk khylan ccianua lan ciate mih lungkhungpaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> maw nynh a cyipaw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:16">Deu 7.16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Joshua nynh yn cceih zah Anak hae kha muaram, Hebron khua, Debir khua, Anab khua, te Judah kya-e muaram hae balyn, Israel muaram hae balyn kyakhe khaleih a maemih hae; Joshua nynh minmin kha mih khua mawte khaleih a robia hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel hae ram kya Anak hae lu kheit san um vae khyh hae; Gaza khua, Gath khua te Ashdod khua kya tuh abang a um ung hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhcite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses a la hopyapaw balyn thyhte, Joshua nynh ram pynpi tuh a law; Joshua nynh Israel hae kha mih phin raveihte rho lang nee hae zah a pya hae. Te ram tuh rhawtuk adae vae.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Moses nynh A Taepaw Siapharan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jordan vaw te nithua lang, Arnon Vaw kyate Hermon Mua kyacia, Arabab nithua lang umpaw ram abalyn kha Israel hae nynh tae hae zah a law hae; e ram kya-e siapharan hae tuh hynh-e hae hynh nynh athua hae:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.1-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Nam 21.21-35</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 2:26-3:11">Deu 2.26—3.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Heshbon khua umpaw Amor hae siapharan Sihon thua zah, aning nynh Arnon Vaw kin vahue kya Aroer khua kyate, te tuh-e vahue angaelung kyate Ammon hae ramri Jabbok vaw kyacia uk zah, Gilead ram angankuh cia a uk bia, <verse number="3" style="v" />te Arabah accya kha mah Khinneroth Rili nithua lang cia, te Beth-jeshimoth khua lang ccianaw laanpi, Arabah rili cikuhpaw Rili Chih kyacia, alia lang Pisgah Mua athonaw kyacia phe a thua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ashtaroth te Edrei khua kya um hae paw Refaim hae kyaze nyathya a laehypaw lu kheit tuh Bashan siapharan Og nynh thua, <verse number="5" style="v" />aning nynh Hermon Mua te Selakah ram te Geshur hae te Maakath hae ramri kyacia Bashan ram abalyn, te Heshbon siapharan Sihon a ramri kyacia Gilead ram angankuh kha a uk. <verse number="6" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu Moses te Israel hae nynh minmin kha a tae hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu Moses nynh mih ram hae tuh Reuben phin hae, Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin angankuh hae kha ccou lan a pya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:33">Nam 32.33</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:12">Deu 3.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Joshua nynh A Taepaw Siapharan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jordan vaw niccaw lang, Lebanon accya kya umpaw Baal-gad khua kyate Seir ram lang akaethungpaw Halak Mua kyacia, Joshua te Israel hae nynh a tae hae paw, e ram kya-e siapharan hae tuh akaw lang thyhte nynh athua, (Joshua nynh mih ram tuh Israel minphuin hae kha mih hanpaw thyhte ccou lan a pya hae, <verse number="8" style="v" />e ram hae tuh muaram, laelung anenaw ram, Arabah accya, apannaw ram, ramkaw te Negeb ram thua hae zah, Hit hae, Amor hae, Kanaan hae, Periz hae, Hiv hae te Jebus hae ram nynh thua):</para>
  <table>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="9" style="v" />Jeriko siapharan </cell>
      <cell style="tc2" align="start">lu kheit</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Ai siapharan, Bethel pe a umpaw </cell>
      <cell style="tc2" align="start">lu kheit</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="10" style="v" />Jerusalem siapharan </cell>
      <cell style="tc2" align="start">lu kheit</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Hebron siapharan </cell>
      <cell style="tc2" align="start">lu kheit</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="11" style="v" />Jarmuth siapharan </cell>
      <cell style="tc2" align="start">lu kheit</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Lakhish siapharan </cell>
      <cell style="tc2" align="start">lu kheit</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="12" style="v" />Eglon siapharan </cell>
      <cell style="tc2" align="start">lu kheit</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Gezer siapharan </cell>
      <cell style="tc2" align="start">lu kheit</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="13" style="v" />Debir siapharan </cell>
      <cell style="tc2" align="start">lu kheit</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">Geder siapharan </cell>
      <cell style="tc2" align="start">lu kheit</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
      <cell style="tc1" align="start">
        <verse number="14" style="v" />Hormah siapharan </cell>
      <cell style="tc2" align="start">lu kheit</cell>
    </row>
    <row style="tr">
