  <para style="m">siapharan hae tuh mih balynte sung thum lu kheit acih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Tae lan ungpaw Ram hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Joshua tuh taw vae zah a kum myarya tang vae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Nang tuh na taw vae zah na kum myarya tang vae, thuasalama law lan zah ccou lanpaw ram patae um ung. <verse number="2" style="v" />E hae hynh lawte ccou lanpaw ram hae nynh thua hae: Filistin hae ram abalynte Geshur hae ram abalyn <verse number="3" style="v" />(Izip nithua lang umpaw Shihor vawkhu kyate thahlang umpaw Ekron ramri kyacia, Ekron tuh Kanaan hae lante riabia athua; te Filistin uktu hae lu pangaw tuh Gaza, Ashdod, Ashkelon, Gath te Ekron nynh thua hae), <verse number="4" style="v" />alia lang tuh Kanaan hae ram abalyn, Sidon hae ram athuapaw Mearah, Amor hae ramri Afek kyacia, <verse number="5" style="v" />Gebal hae ram te nithua lang e Lebanon ram abalyn, Hermon mua kaw umpaw Baal-gad kyate Lebo-hamath khua kyacia, <verse number="6" style="v" />muaram kya um hae paw abalyn, Lebanon mua kyate Misrefoth-maim kyacia, Sidon hae abalyn. Kamaw ccaccei nynh Israel hae malang kyate ka dee cih hae; kaw kae pya vae hawte ram tuh Israel hae kha nee hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:54">Nam 33.54</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu tuh hynh-e ram hynh Israel hae phin takua te Manasseh phin angankuh hae kha rho lang nee hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jordan Nithua lang Ram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Reuben phin, Gad phin te ccangpaw Manasseh phin angankuh hae nynh Moses nynh a pya hae paw mih rho, Jordan khuraw nithua lang kha a ccou hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu Moses nynh a pya hae thyhte:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:33">Nam 32.33</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:12">Deu 3.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Arnon Vaw kin kya umpaw Aroer khua kyate tuh-e vahue ngaelung umpaw khua, Medeba bialae abalynte Dibon kyacia; <verse number="10" style="v" />te Heshbon khua a uktupaw Amor hae siapharan Sihon kya-e khua hae abalyn, Ammon hae ramri kyacia; <verse number="11" style="v" />Gilead ram, Geshur hae te Maakath hae ram, Hermon Mua abalyn, Bashan ram abalynte Salekah kyacia; <verse number="12" style="v" />Ashtaroth khua te Edrei khua a uktupaw Bashan siapharan Og nynh a peenaw abalyn (Refaim minphuin hae kyaze amaw rou hynh nynh a hiinhy vae); e hae hynh Moses nynh tae hae zah a dee hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuhzemah Israel hae nynh Geshur hae te Maakath hae kha dee khyh hae; Geshur te Maakath tuh Israel hae kya atunin cia a um hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Moses nynh Levi phin kyalya kha nynh rho pyabua khyh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kalan maee-ute silawnawpaw hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopya hae thyhte mih rho nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:1">Deu 18.1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Reuben Ram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Moses nynh Reuben phin hae kha mih puizia hae thyhte rho a pya hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Mih ram tuh Arnon Vaw kin umpaw Aroer khua, tuh-e vahue ngaelung umpaw khua te Medeba pe umpaw bialae abalyn; <verse number="17" style="v" />Heshbon te bialae um hae paw a khua hae abalyn, Dibon khua, Bamoth-baal khua, Beth-baal-meon khua, <verse number="18" style="v" />Jahaz khua, Kedemoth khua, Mefaath khua, <verse number="19" style="v" />Kiriathaim khua, Sibmah khua, mua vaw bialae kya umpaw Zereth-shahar khua, <verse number="20" style="v" />Beth-peor khua, Pisgah apandaw hae, Beth-jeshimoth khua, <verse number="21" style="v" />tuh-e hae tuh abialaenaw umpaw khua hae abalynte Heshbon khua a uktupaw, Amor siapharan Sihon a peenaw abalyn nynh thua. Moses nynh Sihon te a ram kya um hae paw Midia hae a cciakhaetu hae Evi, Rekem, Zur, Hur te Reba kha a tae hae, hynh-e cciakhaetu hae tuh tuin ram e Sihon kuihkaw um hae paw bawi hae nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Israel hae nynh a chia hae paw kyaze Beor ccapaw Balaam, naawthyapaw kha mah thaloi te a chiabua hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Reuben phin hae ramri tuh Jordan vaw te a vahue kha nynh thua. E hynh Reuben phin hae nynh mih puizia hae thyhte a ccou hae paw khuapi hae te khua taraw hae nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Gad Ram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Te Moses nynh Gad phin hae kha mah mih puizia hae thyhte rho a pya hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Mih ram tuh Jazer khua te Gilead ram e khua hae abalynte, Ammon hae ram angankuh, Rabbah nithua lang umpaw Aroer khua kyacia, <verse number="26" style="v" />Te Heshbon khua kyate Ramath-mizpeh khua te Betonim khua kyacia, te Mahanaim khua kyate Debir ram kyacia, <verse number="27" style="v" />te Jodan vahue kya umpaw Beth-haram khua, Beth-nimrah khua, Sukkoth khua te Zafon khua, Heshbon siapharan Sihon a peenaw kya-e alaepaw ram; Jordan vaw te a vahue, Khinnereth Rili alia lang athangnaw kyacia, Jordan vaw khuraw nithua lang nynh thua. <verse number="28" style="v" />E tuh Gad phin hae nynh mih puizia thyhte a ccou hae paw khuapi hae te khua taraw hae nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Manasseh Phin Angankuh kya-e Ram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Te Moses nynh Manasseh phin angankuh kha rho a pya hae; Manasseh phin angankuh tuh mih puizia thyhte rho nee athua hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Mih ram tuh Mahanaim kyate Bashan ram abalyn, Bashan siapharan Og a peenaw abalyn, Bashan ram kya umpaw Jair khua hae abalyn khua sung taruh, <verse number="31" style="v" />Gilead ram angankuh, Bashan ram kyaze Og a peenaw kya umpaw Ashtaroth khua te Edrei khua; e ram hae hynh Manasseh ccapaw Makhir ciihan hae—Makhir hae angankuh kha—mih puizia hae thyhte nee athua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />E rho hae tuh Moses nynh Jordan khuraw Jeriko khua nithua lang, Moab bialae kya a nee hae paw rho hae nynh thua. <verse number="33" style="v" />Thuasalama Moses nynh Levi phin hae kha rho pya khyh hae; minmin kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopya hae thyhte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia tuh mih rho nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:20">Nam 18.20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:2">Deu 18.2</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jordan Niccaw lang Ram Neenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E rho hae tuh ranpibawi Eleazar, Nun ccapaw Joshua te Israel phin hae kyaze puizia hae kya-e cciakhaetu hae nynh Israel hae a nee hae paw rho hae nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kya kaw a pya thyhte, phin takua te angankuh hae nynh ccungthydung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ccungthydung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cipaw tuh Pachia rynaw ny nawlan syntawnaw araekuhpaw lung kha mangte ryalawpaw nynh thua.</char></note> te rho kha a ccou hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:52-56">Nam 26.52-56</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 34:13">34.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawccecize Moses nynh phin ning te angankuh hae tuh Jordan khuraw kha rho lang a pya vae hae; thuasalama minmin laku e Levi phin hae kha tuh rho pya khyh hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Josef ciihan kyakhe Manasseh phin te Efraim phin cite phin ning a um hae; Levi hae tuh mih hanpaw ram kha pyabua thua khyh hae, thuasalama umnawpaw khua hae te mih sahiin hae hanlan rampaeekunaw kyalya kha pya athua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.3-4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:33">Nam 32.33</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 34:14-15">34.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 3:12-17">Deu 3.12-17</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kya kaw a pya thyhte, Israel hae nynh a cyi hae, te ram tuh a neeku hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hebron kha Kaleb A Pya hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Judah hae tuh Gilgal khua umpaw Joshua kalan oun cceih hae zah Keniz phin kya-e Jefunneh ccapaw Kaleb nynh Joshua kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Pachia ccungccapaw Moses kha Kadesh-barnea kyakhe nang te kae ka konglang a hopyapaw kha phe na ny vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:30">Nam 14.30</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />E ram hynh dophi khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu Moses nynh Kadesh-barnea kyate kae yn saw lya tuh kum sung pali nynh ka cih ung; ka thinlung kya a um thathyhte amaw kalan bya kha ka phupya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:1-30">Nam 13.1-30</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama kae cceihkheih hae paw ka uno hae nynh ccungccaw hae kha mih lung a rosah hae; tuhzemah kae nynh tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia kha ka thinlung balynte ka zui. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te tuin nin khe Moses nynh byakinkuh zah, ‘Nang nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia kha na thinlung balynte na zui keiccuze, na ccu nynh a sypaw ram tuh nang te na ciihan hae hanlan rho lang zungzae a tang ccaccing cih,’ a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:24">Nam 14.24</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Te atu, na ny vae hawte, Israel hae nynh ramkaw kya a khiaku lya hae ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kha hynh-e bya a hopya lya ccyh kyate kum sung pali kum pangaw lungkhu, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a la ho thyhte yn hiinsah; te atunin tuh kum sung tarya kum pangaw ka cih vae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Moses nynh yn saw nin lya ka thawsae hawte atunin mah ka thawsae ung; rhawtuknaw elang te ccia bungthungnaw elang atu ka thawzung tuh khah lya-e ka thawzung hawmawte nynh athua ung. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze khah nin lyaze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw muaram tuh atu yn pyatua; tuin kya Anak hae a um hae cipaw te akoihkuhpaw khua lepaw hae a um cipaw tuh khah lyaze phe na thae vae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ho hawte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn umkhae zetuh minmin kha ka dee kho hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh Joshua nynh hythuapya zah Jefunneh ccapaw Kaleb kha Hebron khua tuh rho lang a pya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Kaleb nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kha a thinlung balynte a zui keiccuze Hebron khua tuh Keniz phin Jefunneh ccapaw Kaleb rho lang atunin cia a tang. <verse number="15" style="v" />Langmaw lyaze Hebron khua a min tuh Kiriath-arba nynh thua; e Arba tuh Anak hae kyaze alesae huapaw ccungccaw nynh a la thua. Te ram tuh rhawtuknaw adae vae.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Judah Ram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah phin hae nynh ccungthydungte mih puizia thyhte a ccou hae paw ram tuh alia lang Edom ramri, alia lang adianaw Zin ramkaw cia a thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Alia lang ramri tuh Rili Chih adianaw, alia lang a hawipaw rili akouleihnaw kyate <verse number="3" style="v" />Akrabbim cciathungnaw alia lang khate po cceih zah Zin khua cia a thua, te Kadesh-barnea alia langkhe a cceihthung, Hezron khua pe kya Addar khua cia a cceihthung, te Karka khua langkhe a maekuh, <verse number="4" style="v" />Azmon khua lang po cceih koute Izip Vaw kalan po pou zah rili kyakhe athang. E hynh alia lang e nae ramri nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te nithua lang e ramri tuh Rili Chih thua zah Jordan vaw accungkunaw cia a thua. Te thahlang e ramri tuh Jordan vaw accungkunaw, rili akouleihnaw kyate atho; <verse number="6" style="v" />te ramri tuh Beth-hoglah langkhe cceihthung zah Beth-arabah thahlang kya po a cceih; te ramri tuh Reuben ccapaw Bohan Lung kyacia a cceihthung. <verse number="7" style="v" />Te ramri tuh Akhor Accya kyate Debir khua cia a cceihthung; tukoute thahlang cceih zah accya alia langsang umpaw Adummim kaethungnaw te ahawiliakuhpaw Gilgal khua langkhe a maekuh; te ramri tuh En-shemesh tuili kya po cceih zah, Enrogel tuidy kya athang; <verse number="8" style="v" />te ramri tuh Jebus hae umnaw apandaw alia lang (tuh-e tuh Jerusalem nynh thua) kya Hinnom ccapaw kya-e accya langkhe a cceihthung; te ramri tuh niccaw lang, Refaim accya thahlang athangnaw kya umpaw Hinnom accya te ahawiliakunaw umpaw mua dung cia a cceihthung; <verse number="9" style="v" />te ramri tuh mua dung kyate Neftoah Tuidy aphyhnaw cia cceih zah, tuin kyate Efron Mua e khua hae kyacia a cceih, te ramri tuh Baalah (tuh-e tuh Kiriath-jearim nynh thua) langkhe a kouleih, <verse number="10" style="v" />te ramri tuh Baalah khua niccaw langkhe kouleih zah Seir Mua langkhe a cceih, Jearim Mua (tuh-e tuh Khesalon nynh thua) apannaw thahlang khe po cceih zah Beth-shemesh khua lang a cceihbung, te Timmah pe kya po a cceih; <verse number="11" style="v" />te ramri tuh Ekron khua thahlang e sangpyng apannaw langkhe a cceihthung, tukoute Shikkeron langkhe kouleih zah Baalah Mua lang po cceih koute Jabneel khua kya a thua; te ramri tuh rili kya athang. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te niccaw lang e ramri tuh Mediterranean rili te a vahue nynh thua. E hynh Judah phin hae mih puizia thyhte, po avoilupaw ramri nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Kaleb nynh A Hanpaw A Law</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JDG 1:11-15">Bpt 1.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua kya kaw a pya thyhte, Joshua nynh Judah hae laku e Jefunneh ccapaw Kaleb a hanpaw Hebron khua cikuhpaw Kiriath-arba kha a pya, (Arba tuh Anak a paaw nynh thua)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.13-14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:20">Bpt 1.20</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Te Kaleb nynh tuin kyate Anak ccapaw hae lu thum: Sheshai, Ahiman te Talmai, Anak ciihan hae kha a dee hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuin kyate Debir khua kya um hae paw kha dou lan a ccianua thung hae; langmaw lyaze Debir a min tuh Kiriath-sefer acikuh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Kaleb nynh, “Kiriath-sefer khua kha tuk zah a taepaw tuh ka ccanung Aksah hynh zu lang ka pya cih,” a ci. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Kaleb neitaw Kenaz ccapaw Othniel nynh tae zah, Kaleb nynh a ccanung Aksah kha zu lang a pya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Aksah nynh Othniel kya he a thua te, a paaw kha loo lookheit na ngia cih cite Othniel kha a hopya. Aksah tuh lann tungvaw te he a rung te, Kaleb nynh, “Pawmou na ry?” cite a khia. <verse number="19" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Lasung ccangkheit beih yn pya; Negeb ram kya nae nung keiccuze tuisung hae kha mah yn pyabia,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Kaleb nynh thahlang tuisung hae te alia tuisung hae kha a pya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Judah Khua hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Judah phin hae nynh mih puizia hae thyhte a ccou hae paw rho tuh e hae hynh nynh thua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Edom ramri lang, Alia lang kou kya Judah phin hae nynh a hoi hae paw khua hae tuh Kabzeel, Eder, Jagur, <verse number="22" style="v" />Kinah, Dimonah, Adadah, <verse number="23" style="v" />Kedesh, Hazor, Ithnan, <verse number="24" style="v" />Zif, Telem, Bealoth, <verse number="25" style="v" />Hazor-hadattah, Kerioth-hezron (tuh-e tuh Hazor nynh thua), <verse number="26" style="v" />Amam, Shema, Moladah, <verse number="27" style="v" />Hazar-gaddah, Heshmon, Bethpelet, <verse number="28" style="v" />Hazar-shual, Beersheba, Biziothiah, <verse number="29" style="v" />Baalah, Iim, Ezem, <verse number="30" style="v" />Eltolad, Khesil, Hormah, <verse number="31" style="v" />Ziklag, Madmannah, Sansannah, <verse number="32" style="v" />Lebaoth, Shilhim, Ain te Rimmon; mih khua taraw hae ryte abalynte khua kuin lae takua acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Te laelung anenaw kyaze Eshtaol, Zorah, Ashnah, <verse number="34" style="v" />Zanoah, En-gannim, Tappuah, Enam, <verse number="35" style="v" />Jarmuth, Adullam, Sokoh, Azekah, <verse number="36" style="v" />Shaaraim, Adithaim, Gederah, Gederothaim; mih khua taraw hae ryte khua haw lae pali acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zenan, Hadashah, Migdal-gad, <verse number="38" style="v" />Dilan, Mizpah, Jokthe-el, <verse number="39" style="v" />Lakhish, Bozkath, Eglon, <verse number="40" style="v" />Kabbon, Lahmam, Khitlish, <verse number="41" style="v" />Gederoth, Beth-dagon, Naamah te Makkedah; mih khua taraw hae ryte khua haw lae taruh acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Libnah, Ether, Ashan, <verse number="43" style="v" />Iftah, Ashnah, Nezib, <verse number="44" style="v" />Keilah, Akhzib, te Mareshah; mih khua taraw hae ryte khua takua acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ekron khua te a pepan e khua hae te khua taraw hae ryte, <verse number="46" style="v" />Ekron kyate rili kyacia, Ashdod khua te anaekuh hae paw abalyn, mih khua taraw hae ryte.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ashdod khua te a pepan e khua hae te khua taraw hae; Gaza khuapi te a pepan e khua hae te khua taraw hae; Izip Vaw, Rili Lepaw te a vahue hae kyacia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Te muaram kyaze Shamir, Jattir, Sokoh, <verse number="49" style="v" />Dannah, Kiriath-sannah (tuh-e tuh Debir nynh thua), <verse number="50" style="v" />Anab, Eshtemoth, Anim, <verse number="51" style="v" />Goshen, Holon te Giloh; mih khua taraw hae ryte khua haw lae kheit acih. <verse number="52" style="v" />Arab, Dumah, Eshan, <verse number="53" style="v" />Janim, Beth-tappuah, Afekah, <verse number="54" style="v" />Humtah, Kiriath-arba (tuh-e tuh Hebron nynh thua) te Zior; mih khua taraw hae ryte khua takua acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Maon, Karmel, Zif, Juttah, <verse number="56" style="v" />Jezreel, Jokdeam, Zanoah, <verse number="57" style="v" />Kain, Gibeah te Timnah; mih khua taraw hae ryte khua haw acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Halhul, Beth-zur, Gedor, <verse number="59" style="v" />Maarath, Beth-anoth te Eltekon; mih khua taraw hae ryte khua taruh acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Kiriath-baal (tuh-e tuh Kiriath-jearim nynh thua) te Rabbah; mih khua taraw hae ryte khua ning acih. <verse number="61" style="v" />Ramkaw kya, Beth-arabah, Middin, Sekakah, <verse number="62" style="v" />Nibshan, Loi Khua te En-gedi; mih khua taraw hae ryte khua taruh acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Thuasalama Judah hae nynh Jerusalem khua kya um hae paw Jebus hae kha dee kho khyh hae; tukeiccuze Jebus hae tuh Judah hae ryte Jerusalem kya atunin cia a umkheih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.63: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:21">Bpt 1.21</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:6">2Sa 5.6</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 11:4">1Sh 11.4</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Efraim Ram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josef ciihan hae nynh ccungthydungte a ccou hae paw ram tuh Jeriko khua pe Jordan vawkhu kin umpaw Jeriko tuili nithua lang kyate ramkaw langkhe a tee, te Jeriko kyate muaram lang Bethel khua cia a cceihthung; <verse number="2" style="v" />tukoute Bethel kyate Luz lang cceih zah Arki hae ram e Ataroth khua lang po a thua; <verse number="3" style="v" />te niccaw lang cceihbung zah Jaflet hae ram lang Alia Beth-horon khua cia a thua; te Gezer lang po cceih zah rili kya athang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Josef ciihan hae Manasseh te Efraim nynh mih rho kha a ccou hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Efraim phin hae nynh mih puizia thyhte a ccou hae paw ram tuh akaw lang thyhte nynh thua: nithua lang te mih rho ramri tuh Ataroth-addar kyate Palung Beth-horon kyacia a thua; <verse number="6" style="v" />te ramri tuh tuin kyate rili langkhe a cceihbung; thahlang ramri tuh Mikmethath khua nynh thua; nithua lang ramri tuh Taanath-shiloh khua langkhe bua kouleih zah, tuh-e khua he a khung te nithua lang Janoah lang a cceih, <verse number="7" style="v" />te Janoah kyate Ataroth te Naarah kyacia cceihbung zah Jeriko khua a thua koute Jordan vaw khe athang. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tappuah khua kyate ramri tuh niccaw langkhe Kanah Vaw lang po cceih zah rili kya athang. Tuhcite Efraim phin hae nynh mih puizia thyhte ram kha a ccou hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Manasseh ram lungkhu khe Efraim hae hanlan a nung hae paw khua hae balyn tuh mih khua taraw hae ryte Efraim hae nynh a ccou hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama Gezer kya um hae paw Kanaan hae kha minmin nynh dee khyh hae; tukeiccuze Kanaan hae tuh Efraim hae kyakhe atunin cia a umbua hae, thuasalama riasepaw rya kha a lawsah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:29">Bpt 1.29</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ccangpaw Manasseh Phin Angankuh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te Manasseh tuh Josef a ccatawccaw athua keiccuze ccungthydungte Manasseh phin kha ram a pya hae. Manasseh a ccatawccaw Makhir, Gilead a paaw tuh rhawkaw athua keiccuze Gilead ram te Bashan ram kha a pya hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te tuhlaepaw Manasseh phin hae tuh mih puizia thyhte, Abiezer, Helek, Asriel, Shekhem, Hefer te Shemida kha ccungthydungte a nee hae; e hae tuh mih puizia thyhte Josef ccapaw Manasseh ciihan pise hae nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Manasseh ccapaw Makhir, Makhir ccapaw Gilead, Gilead ccapaw Hefer, Hefer ccapaw Zelofehad tuh ccapaw saah khyh, ccanung hae kyalya nynh a saah; a ccanung hae min tuh: Mahlah, Noah, Hoglah, Milkah te Tirzah nynh thua hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin nynh ranpibawi Eleazar, Nun ccapaw Joshua te cciakhaetu hae kalan oun cceih hae zah, “Kaening hynh kae puizia pise hae ryte rho pyabua lan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kha kaw a pya,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kawbya thyhte mih paaw uno hae ryte rho kha a pyabua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:1-7">Nam 27.1-7</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuhcite Jordan khuraw lang umpaw Gilead ram te Bashan ram kha hobia leite, Manasseh nynh pum haw kha a ccou; <verse number="6" style="v" />pawccecize Manasseh a ccanung hae nynh a ccapaw hae ryte rho kha a ccoubua vae hae. Gilead ram tuh ccangpaw Manasseh phin hae nynh a ccou hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Manasseh ram tuh Asher kyate Shekhem nithua lang umpaw Mikmethath kyacia a thua, te ramri tuh alia lang En-Tappuah hae umnaw cia a thua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tappuah ram tuh Manasseh kya-e nynh thua, thuasalama Manasseh ramri kya umpaw Tappuah khua tuh Efraim ciihan hae kya-e nynh thua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te ramri tuh Kanah Vaw langkhe a cceihbung. E vaw kyate alia lang e Manasseh khua hae kya umpaw khua hae tuh Efraim kya-e nynh thua. Te Manasseh ramri tuh tuh-e vaw thahlang khe po cceih zah rili kyakhe athang. <verse number="10" style="v" />Alia lang e ram tuh Efraim ram thua zah thahlang e ram tuh Manasseh ram nynh thua, ramri tuh rili nynh thua, thahlang tuh Asher ram cia thua zah, nithua lang tuh Issakhar ram kyacia a thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te Issakhar ram te Asher ram lungkhu hin, Beth-shean khua te a khua taraw hae, Ibleam khua te a khua taraw hae, Dor khua te a khua taraw hae kya um hae paw, Endor khua te a khua taraw hae kya um hae paw, Taanak khua te a khua taraw hae kya um hae paw, Megiddo khua te a khua taraw hae kya um hae paw tuh Manasseh kya-e nynh thua hae; (ccangthumnaw tuh Nafath nynh thua). <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuhzemah Manasseh ciihan hae nynh tuh-e khua hae tuh ccou kho khyh hae; Kanaan hae tuh tuh-e ram kya po um hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama Israel hae nynh mih thawzung he yn um tuh, Kanaan hae kha riasepaw rya a lawsah hae, thuasalama marya te tuh dee kou khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Josef Phin nynh Byalungnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Te Josef phin hae nynh Joshua kha, “Kaening tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hythua oun pya zah milu myarya kae lung vae, pawccemou pum kheit, ram kheit kyalya hynh rho lang nae pya?” a cipya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh minmin kha, “Nanning tuh milu myarya na lung oh zah, Efraim kya-e muaram tuh nae hanlan eih aby lanze, Periz hae te Refaim hae ram umpaw tuhpi kalan khuin la cceihthung oh lah, la vawkuh oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Josef phin hae nynh, “Muaram tuh kae hanlan zaw khyh; Beth-shean khua te a khua taraw hae kya um hae paw te Jezreel Accya te a khua taraw hae kya um hae paw Kanaan hae balyn tuh sivaw marangle a hoi hae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh Josef ciihan athua hae paw Efraim phin te Manasseh phin hae kyakhe, “Nanning tuh milu na lung ccaccing oh zah thawzung myarya na hoi oh; nae hanpaw ccangkheit kyalya tetuh na ccou lan khyh oh, <verse number="18" style="v" />muaram tuh nae kya-e athua cih, tuhpi athua zemah na vawkuh cih oh zah ramri adianaw kyacia na ccou cih oh; Kanaan hae tuh sivaw marangle hoi hae zah athung hae zemah na dee cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Tuhlaepaw Phin hae Ram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te Israel zapi hae balyn tuh Shiloh khua kya pumkuh hae zah, tungkunaw bu kha a sak hae; ram tuh a tae vae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel hae kyakhe rho a neebua loh lei hae paw phin sari a um ung hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Joshua nynh Israel hae kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nae minpaaw hae Pachia nynh ae pya oh paw ram lang tee lan zah ccou lanpaw kha hohseciamou na sawphahkuh ung cih oh? <verse number="4" style="v" />Phin kheit kyate lu thum cci oun popah oh lah, ka saw cih hae, minmin nynh ram phe lekuh lan a cceih cih hae zah, mih hanpaw rho kha a muih hae thyhte a zei cih hae zah, ka kalan oun thuakhae cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin nynh ram kha ccangsari lang a ia cih hae, Judah hae tuh alia lang e mimaw ram kya a um cih hae zah, Josef ciihan hae tuh thahlang e mimaw ram kya a um cih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Ram kha ccangsari lang iate na zei cih oh zah, tuh-e na zei oh paw tuh ka kalan nae thuakhae cih oh; te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia malang kya nae hanlan ccungthy kae dungsah cih oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Levi phin hae tuh nanning kya mih hanpaw hoibua khyh hae, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e ranpibawi thuanaw tuh mih rho nynh thua; te Gad, Reuben te Manasseh phin angankuh hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu Moses nynh a pya hae paw, Jordan nithua lang e mih rho kha a ccou vae hae,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te tuh-e ccungccaw hae tuh a thokuh hae; ram konglang zei lan a cceih hae paw kha Joshua nynh, “Ram lungkhu phe lekuh lan la cceih oh lah, ram konglang nae zei cih oh zah, ka kalan nae ki cih oh; te Shiloh kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe nae hanlan ccungthy kae dungsah cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh-e ccungccaw hae nynh ram lungkhu phe lekuh lan cceih hae zah, akhua khua te ccangsari lang a ia hae paw ram konglang tuh ccauh kya a zei hae; te Shiloh khua ryahmin kya umpaw Joshua kalan a ki hae, <verse number="10" style="v" />Shiloh khua kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe Joshua nynh ccungthy a dungsah hae; Joshua nynh Israel hae kha ram tuh mih hanpaw raveihte a nee hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Benjamin Ram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Benjamin phin hae nynh ccungthydung hae zah mih puizia thyhte a ccou hae paw ram tuh Judah phin te Josef phin laku khe nynh a um. <verse number="12" style="v" />Thahlang e mih ramri tuh Jordan kyate tho zah thahlang umpaw Jeriko apannaw kalan a cceihthung, te niccaw langkhe muaram kya po cceih zah, Beth-aven ramkaw kya athang. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuin kyate ramri tuh Luz langkhe alia lang po cceih zah Luz (tuh-e tuh Bethel nynh thua) apannaw kya a thua, tukoute ramri tuh Alia Beth-horon khua alia lang umpaw mua vawlan e Ataroth-addar khua cia a cceihbung. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te ramri tuh ccanglang maekuh zah niccaw ramri lang a tang. Beth-horon alia lang umpaw mua kyate alia lang cceih zah Kiriath-baal khua kya athang (tuh-e tuh Kiriath-jearim khua nynh thua), tuh-e khua tuh Judah phin hae kya-e nynh thua. E hynh niccaw lang e ramri nynh thua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te alia lang ramri tuh Kiriath-jearim athangnaw kyate tho zah, tuin kyate Efron langkhe Neftoah Tuidy aphyhnaw cia a thua, <verse number="16" style="v" />te ramri tuh Refaim accya thahlang athangnaw kya umpaw Hinnom ccapaw kya-e accya te ahawiliakuhpaw mua leihpaw langkhe a cceihbung; te Jebus hae umnaw apannaw alia lang umpaw Hinnom accya khe cceihbung zah, Enrogel cia a cceihbung; <verse number="17" style="v" />te thahlang khe maekuh thung zah En-shemesh kyacia a thua, tuin kyate Adummim kaethungnaw te ahawiliakuhpaw Geliloth khua langkhe a cceih; te Reuben ccapaw Bohan Lung langkhe a cceihbung; <verse number="18" style="v" />te Beth-arabah apannaw thahlang khe po cceih zah, Arabah khua lang a cceihbung; <verse number="19" style="v" />te ramri tuh Beth-hoglah apannaw thahlang khe po cceih zah, Rili Chih te thahlang rili akouleihnaw, Jordan vaw alia lang athangnaw kyakhe athang. E hynh alia lang e ramri nynh thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Jordan tuh nithua lang e ramri nynh thua. E hynh Benjamin phin hae nynh mih puizia thyhte, ramri nynh po a voilu lante a ccou hae paw ram nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamin phin hae nynh mih puizia thyhte a ccou hae paw khua hae tuh Jeriko, Beth-hoglah, Emek-keziz, <verse number="22" style="v" />Beth-arabah, Zemaraim, Bethel, <verse number="23" style="v" />Avvim, Parah, Ofrah, <verse number="24" style="v" />Khefar-ammoni, Ofni te Geba—mih khua taraw hae ryte khua haw lae ning acih; <verse number="25" style="v" />Gibeon, Ramah, Beeroth, <verse number="26" style="v" />Mizpeh, Khefirah, Mozah, <verse number="27" style="v" />Rekem, Irpeel, Taralah, <verse number="28" style="v" />Zela, Haelef, Jebus (tuh-e tuh Jerusalem nynh thua), Gibeah te Kiriath-jearim—mih khua taraw hae ryte khua haw lae pali acih. E hynh Benjamin phin hae nynh mih puizia thyhte a ccou hae paw ram nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Simeon Ram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ccangningnaw ccungthydungnaw tuh Simeon hanlan te Simeon phin hanlan mih puizia thyhte yn pou; mih hanpaw ram tuh Judah phin kya-e ram lungkhu khe nynh a um. <verse number="2" style="v" />Mih hanpaw ram kya umpaw khua hae tuh Beersheba, Sheba, Moladah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.2-8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 4:28-33">1Sh 4.28-33</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Hazar-shual, Balah, Ezem, <verse number="4" style="v" />Eltolad, Bethul, Hormah, <verse number="5" style="v" />Ziklag, Beth-markaboth, Hazar-susah, <verse number="6" style="v" />Beth-lebaoth, te Sharuhen—mih khua taraw hae ryte khua haw lae thum acih; <verse number="7" style="v" />Ain, Rimmon, Ether te Ashan—mih khua taraw hae ryte khua pali acih; <verse number="8" style="v" />e khua hae po voilu lan um hae paw mih khua taraw hae balyn tuh Baalath-beer, Negeb ram e Ramah kyacia. E hynh Simeon phin hae nynh mih puizia thyhte a ccou hae paw ram nynh thua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Simeon phin nynh a ccoupaw ram tuh Judah ram kya a umbua; Judah phin nynh a ccoupaw ram tuh mih hanlan eih ale keiccuze mih ram lungkhu khe Simeon phin nynh ram kha a ccoubua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Zebulun Ram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ccangthumnaw ccungthydungnaw tuh Zebulun phin hanlan mih puizia thyhte yn pou. Mih ramri tuh Sarid kyacia a thua; <verse number="11" style="v" />te mih ramri tuh niccaw langkhe cceihthung zah Maralah lang po a cceih, Dabbesheth kha tung zah Jokneam nithua lang umpaw vaw kalan a cceih; <verse number="12" style="v" />te ramri tuh Sarid kyate nithua lang cceih zah Khisloth-tabor ramri cia a thua; tuin kyate Deberath lang cceih zah Jafia cia a cceihthung; <verse number="13" style="v" />tuin kyate nithua langkhe po cceih zah Gath-hefer, Eth-kazin kyacia a thua, te Rimmon lang cceih zah Neah langkhe a kouleih; <verse number="14" style="v" />te thahlang ramri tuh Hannathon langkhe maekuh zah Iftah-el accya kya athang; <verse number="15" style="v" />te Kattath, Hahalal, Shimron, Idalah, te Bethlehem—mih khua taraw hae ryte khua haw lae ning acih. <verse number="16" style="v" />E khua hae te mih khua taraw hae tuh Zebulun phin nynh mih puizia thyhte a ccou hae paw ram nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Issakhar Ram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ccangpalinaw ccungthydungnaw tuh Issakhar hanlan mih puizia thyhte yn pou. <verse number="18" style="v" />Mih ram kyakhe Jezreel, Khesulloth, Shunem, <verse number="19" style="v" />Hafaraim, Shion, Anaharath, <verse number="20" style="v" />Rabbith, Kishion, Ebez, <verse number="21" style="v" />Remeth, En-gannim, En-haddah te Beth-pazzez khua hae a um hae, <verse number="22" style="v" />ramri tuh Tabor, Shahazumah, te Beth-shemesh kya thua zah, Jordan kya athang—mih khua taraw hae ryte khua haw lae taruh acih. <verse number="23" style="v" />E khua hae te mih khua taraw hae tuh Issakhar phin hae nynh mih puizia thyhte a ccou hae paw ram nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Asher Ram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ccangpangawnaw ccungthydungnaw tuh Asher phin hanlan mih puizia thyhte yn pou. <verse number="25" style="v" />Mih ram lungkhu kya Helkath, Hali, Beten, Akhshaf, <verse number="26" style="v" />Allammelek, Amad te Mishal khua hae a um hae; ramri tuh niccaw langkhe Karmel te Shihor-libnath khua cia phe a thua, <verse number="27" style="v" />nithua lang maekuh zah Beth-dagon langkhe cceih zah Zebulun te Iftah-el accya kya a thua, thahlang khe Beth-emek te Neiel lang a cceih; te thahlang po cceih zah Kabul, <verse number="28" style="v" />Ebron, Rehob, Hammon, Kanah te Sidon Lepaw kyacia a thua; <verse number="29" style="v" />te ramri tuh Ramah langkhe maekuh zah akoihkuhpaw Tair khuapi kya a thua; te ramri tuh Hosah lang maekuh zah rili kya athang; Mahalab, Akhzib, <verse number="30" style="v" />Ummah, Afek te Rehob—mih khua taraw hae ryte khua kuin lae ning acih. <verse number="31" style="v" />E khua hae te mih khua taraw hae tuh Asher phin hae nynh mih puizia thyhte a ccou hae paw ram nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Naftali Ram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ccangtaruhnaw ccungthydungnaw tuh Neftali phin hanlan mih puizia thyhte yn pou. <verse number="33" style="v" />Mih ramri tuh Helef te Zaanannim kya umpaw phaesi ku, Adami-nekeb te Jabneel kyate tho zah Lakkum cia a thua, te Jordan kya athang; <verse number="34" style="v" />te ramri tuh niccaw langkhe Aznoth-tabor kyacia a maekuh, tuin kyate Hukkok lang cceih zah alia lang umpaw Zebulun a thua, niccaw langkhe Asher, nithua langkhe Judah ram Jordan vawkhu cia a thua. <verse number="35" style="v" />Akoihkuhpaw khua hae tuh Ziddim, Zer, Hammath, Rakkath, Khinnereth, <verse number="36" style="v" />Adamah, Ramah, Hazor, <verse number="37" style="v" />Kedesh, Edrei, En-hazor, <verse number="38" style="v" />Ziron, Migdal-el, Horem, Beth-anath te Beth-shemesh—mih khua taraw hae ryte khua haw lae takua acih. <verse number="39" style="v" />E khua hae te mih khua taraw hae tuh Naftali phin nynh mih puizia thyhte a ccou hae paw ram nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Dan Ram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ccangsarinaw ccungthydungnaw tuh Dan phin hanlan mih puizia thyhte yn pou. <verse number="41" style="v" />Mih ram lungkhu kya Zorah, Eshtaol, Ir-shemesh, <verse number="42" style="v" />Shaalabbin, Aijalon, Ithlah, <verse number="43" style="v" />Elon, Timnah, Ekron, <verse number="44" style="v" />Eltekeh, Gibbethon, Baalath, <verse number="45" style="v" />Jehud, Bene-berak, Gath-rimmon, <verse number="46" style="v" />Mejarkon, Rakkon te Joppa te arawsekunaw ram tuh a um hae. <verse number="47" style="v" />Dan phin hae nynh mih ram kha he a shung hae tuh, Leshem khua kha ccianua thung hae zah a tuk hae, tuh-e khua tuh lah hae zah thaloi te a theih kou hae te, tuin kya khua a sah hae; mih minpaaw Dan min kha lah hae zah Leshem khua tuh Dan khua a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 18:27-29">Bpt 18.27-29</ref></char></note> <verse number="48" style="v" />E khua hae te mih khua taraw hae tuh Dan phin hae nynh mih puizia thyhte a ccou hae paw ram nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Joshua Rho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Israel hae nynh ram patae kha rho lang he a neekuh kou hae te, Nun ccapaw Joshua kha rho a pyabua hae. <verse number="50" style="v" />Joshua nynh a ngiapaw khua, Efraim muaram kya umpaw Timnath-serah khua kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kawpyanaw thyhte a pya hae; aning nynh tuh-e khua tuh raethui zah a umnaw.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />E hynh ranpibawi Eleazar, Nun ccapaw Joshua te Israel phin hae kyaze puizia hae kya-e cciakhaetu hae nynh Shiloh khua kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang, tungkunaw bu thuakaw kya ccungthydungte a nee hae paw rho hae nynh thua. Tuhcite ram neekunaw tuh a thangsah hae.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Khynnaw Khuapi hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Nam 35.9-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Joshua kyakhe,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.1-9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Nam 35.9-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:41-43">Deu 4.41-43</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">19.1-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />“Israel ccungccaw hae kha, ‘Moses kyate nanning kae hopya oh paw khynnaw khua hae kha rae oh, <verse number="3" style="v" />tuhteze nynh tuaku ty leite ccungccaw a theihseipaw nynh tuh-e khua langkhe a ccue cih; tuh-e khua hae tuh nae hanlan chiise phulahtu kuih kyate khynnawpaw khua lang a tang cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ccungccaw theihtu tuh tuh-e khua khuakhakheit langkhe la ccue cih zah, khua koikua teenaw kya a thadyn cih, te tuin khua kya-e piccan hae kyakhe acyikunaw kong kha a hopah cih hae; te minmin nynh khua lungkhu lang a cciakhae cih hae zah, umnaw hmin kha a pya cih hae, te minmin kyatuin a um cih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te chiise phulahtupaw nynh a deehui lanze, ccungccaw theihtupaw kha ap lan khyh hae, pawccecize a chiapaw a innpaw paw tuh langmaw ze rhawkunaw um leite a chiaseipaw nynh thua. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te ccungccaw theihtupaw tuh zapi malang byapia athua mawlaezung te tuh-e ccyh lya-e ranpibawi lupi a chi mawlaezung tuh tuin khua kya a um cih, tukoute ccungccaw theihtu tuh a ccuetawpaw a khua te a inn langkhe a kithui cih,’ cite hopah hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Galilee ram, Naftali muaram e Kedesh khua, Efraim muaram e Shekhem khua te Judah muaram e Kiriath-arba (tuh-e tuh Hebron nynh thua) khua kha a po hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te Jeriko nithua lang Jordan khuraw langkhe Reuben phin kya-e abialaenaw ram ramkaw kya umpaw Bezer khua, Gad phin kya-e Gilead ram umpaw Ramoth khua te Manasseh phin kya-e Bashan ram kya umpaw Golan khua kha a po hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />E khua hae tuh Israel hae balyn te minmin kya a umbua hae paw ramccang hae hanlan, tuaku ty leite ccungccaw theihseipaw tuh ccungccaw zapi malang byapia athua mawlaezung, chiise phulahtu kuih keiccu a chi khyh nawlan a ccue nawlan cite a po hae paw khua hae nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Levi Phin kya-e Khuapi hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te Levi phin kyaze puizia hae kya-e cciakhaetu hae nynh ranpibawi Eleazar, Nun ccapaw Joshua te Israel phin hae kyaze puizia hae kya-e cciakhaetu hae kalan oun cceih hae zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />Kanaan ram kya umpaw Shiloh khua khe minmin kha, “Kae umnaw lanpaw khua hae te kae sahiin hae hanlan rampaeekunaw tuh kaening elang pya khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kyate kaw phe pya vae,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:1-8">Nam 35.1-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kawpyanaw thyhte Israel hae nynh mih ram lungkhu umpaw akawlan e khua hae te sahiin rampaeenaw kha Levi phin hae a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kohath puizia hae hanlan ccungthydungnaw tuh yn pou. Tukeiccuze ranpibawi Aaron ciihan athua hae paw Levi phin hae nynh ccungthydung hae zah Judah phin, Simeon phin te Benjamin phin hae kyate khua haw lae thum kha a mue hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te a laehy hae paw Kohath ciihan hae nynh Efraim phin, Dan phin te Manasseh phin angankuh kya-e puizia hae kyate ccungthydungte khua haw a mue hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gershon ciihan hae nynh Issakhar phin, Asher phin, Naftali phin te Bashan ram kya umpaw Manasseh phin angankuh hae kya-e puizia hae kyate ccungthydungte khua haw lae thum a mue hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Merari ciihan hae nynh mih puizia thyhte Reuben phin, Gad phin te Zebulun phin hae kyate khua haw lae ning kha a mue hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kyate kaw a pya hae thyhte e khua hae te sahiin rampaeenaw hae hynh ccungthydungte Israel hae nynh Levi phin hae kha a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Levi phin kya umpaw Kohath puizia hae kya-e Aaron ciihan hae nynh Judah phin te Simeon phin hae ram kya-e <verse number="10" style="v" />akawlan e khua hae kha a ccou hae, pawccecize ccungthydung hae zah minmin tuh masaty a ccan hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Judah muaram kya umpaw Hebron khua a ci hae paw Kiriath-arba khua (Arba tuh Anak paaw nynh thua) te a pepan e sahiin rampaeenaw hae tuh a pya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Thuasalama khua pepan e loo hae te khua taraw hae tuh Jefunneh ccapaw Kaleb kha a uccaw lang a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te ranpibawi Aaron ciihan hae tuh ccungccaw theihtu hanlan khynnaw khua athuapaw Hebron khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Libnah khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="14" style="v" />Jattir khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Eshtemoa khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="15" style="v" />Holon khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Debir khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="16" style="v" />Ain khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Juttah khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Beth-shemesh khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae—e phin ning hae ram lungkhu te khua khuatakua kha pya athua hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Benjamin phin hae ram lungkhu te Gibeon khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Geba khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="18" style="v" />Anathoth khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Almon khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae—khua khuapali kha pya athua hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Aaron ciihan ranpibawi hae nynh a ccou hae paw khua hae tuh mih sahiin rampaeenaw hae ryte khua abalyn khua haw lae thum acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Levi phin kyaze Kohath puizia hae kya-e a laehypaw Kohath ciihan hae nynh ccungthydungte a ccou hae paw khua hae tuh Efraim phin hae ram lungkhu e nynh thua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Minmin a pya hae paw tuh Efraim muaram kya um zah ccungccaw theihtu hanlan khynnaw khua athuapaw Shekhem khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Gezer khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="22" style="v" />Kibzaim khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Beth-horon khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae—khua khuapali kha pya athua hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Dan phin hae ram lungkhu te Elteke khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Gibbethon khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="24" style="v" />Aijalon khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Gath-rimmon khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae—khua khuapali kha pya athua hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Manasseh phin angankuh hae ram lungkhu te Taanak khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Gath-rimmon khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae—khua khuaning kha pya athua hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Kohath ciihan hae kya-e a laehypaw puizia hae nynh a ccou hae paw khua hae tuh mih sahiin rampaeenaw hae ryte khua abalyn khua haw acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Te Levi puizia hae kya-e Gershon ciihan hae tuh Manasseh phin angankuh hae ram lungkhu te ccungccaw theihtu hae hanlan khynnaw khua thua zah, Bashan ram kya umpaw Golan khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Beeshterah khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae—khua khuaning kha pya athua hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Issakhar phin hae ram lungkhu te Kishion khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Daberath khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="29" style="v" />Jarmuth khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, En-gannim khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae—khua khuapali kha pya athua hae; <verse number="30" style="v" />Asher phin hae ram lungkhu te Mishal khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Abdon khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="31" style="v" />Helkath khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae te Rehoh khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae—khua khuapali kha pya athua hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Naftali phin hae ram lungkhu te ccungccaw theihtu hae hanlan khynnaw khua thua zah Galilee ram kya umpaw Kedesh khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Hammoth-dor khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Kartan khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae—khua khuathum kha pya athua hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Gershon ciihan hae kya-e puizia hae patae nynh a ccou hae paw khua hae tuh mih sahiin hae rampaeenaw ram ryte khua abalyn khua haw lae thum acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A laehypaw Levi phin hae kya-e Merari puizia hae hanlan pyapaw khua hae tuh Zebulun phin hae ram lungkhu te Jokneam khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Kartah khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="35" style="v" />Dimnah khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Nahalal khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae—khua khuapali kha pya athua hae. <verse number="36" style="v" />Reuben phin hae ram lungkhu te Bezer khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Jahzah khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="37" style="v" />Kedemoth khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae te Mefaath khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae—khua khuapali kha pya athua hae. <verse number="38" style="v" />Gad phin hae ram lungkhu te ccungccaw theihtu hanlan khynnaw khua thua zah Gilead ram kya umpaw Ramoth khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="39" style="v" />Heshbon khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae—abalynte khua khuapali kha pya athua hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />A laehypaw Levi phin hae kya-e Merari puizia patae nynh ccungthydungte a ccou hae paw khua hae tuh abalynte khua khuahaw lae ning acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Israel hae nynh a ccou hae paw ram hae lungkhu kya Levi hae khua tuh mih sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae ryte khua abalyn sung pali khua tarya acih. <verse number="42" style="v" />E khua hae raveih nynh mih pepan kya sahiin rampaeenaw hae kha ccarou a hoi hae; tuhcite e khua hae balyn tuh a um hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuhcite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae tuh, kae pya cih oh cite mih minpaaw hae kya bya a la kinpyaku hae paw ram hae balyn kha a pya hae; ram kha lah hae zah tuin kya khua a sah hae. <verse number="44" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh mih minpaaw hae kya bya a la kinpyaku hae thyhte, mih pepan balyn kya daenaw a pya hae; mih rhaw hae lu kheit nynh sanmah mih malang thadyn kho khyh hae, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh mih rhaw hae balyn kha mih kuih kya a pya vae hae. <verse number="45" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae kya ahoypaw bya a kinpyaku hae paw balyn tuh ccangkheit sanmah zo khyh; abalynte marya accing.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Nithua lang e hae A Ki hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh Reuben phin hae, Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin angankuh kha ko hae zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />minmin kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu Moses nynh ae hopya oh paw balyn kha na rae oh zah, kaw kae pya oh paw ka bya kha na ngae oh;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:20-32">Nam 32.20-32</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:12-15">Jos 1.12-15</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />atunin cia hynhsepi aro vae paw nae uno hae kha na vua khyh oh zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae naw oh paw kha tynkaring lan na law oh. <verse number="4" style="v" />Atu tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nae uno hae kha bya a kinpyaku hae hawte haeungnaw a pya vae hae; tukeiccuze ki oh lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu Moses nynh Jordan vaw khuraw lang e ae pya oh paw nae hanpaw umnaw ram kya nae inn lang cciatua oh. <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryalahtu Moses nynh kaw ae pya oh paw kawbya te phungbya hae athuapaw: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia sungsah lanpaw, a laanpi zui lanpaw, a kawbya hae rae lanpaw, amaw kya tynkaring lan kyngku lanpaw, te nae thinlung balynte nae hiinnaw balynte amaw ryalawpya lanpaw kha hoyte raeringku tua oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh hythuapya hae zah a kisah vae hae, te minmin tuh mih inn lang a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Te Moses nynh Manasseh phin angankuh kha Bashan kya umpaw mih hanpaw kha a pya hae; thuasalama Joshua nynh ccangpaw angankuh kha tuh Jordan te niccaw lang ram kya mih uno hae pe khe mih hanpaw kha a pya hae. Te Joshua nynh minmin kha hythuanaw pya hae zah mih inn lang he a kisah hae te, <verse number="8" style="v" />minmin kha, “Uccaw patae te sahiin patae te ngun, sui, daw, sivaw te boeining patae kha phukute nae inn lang la cceih oh; nae rhaw hae kya-e na law oh paw rhaw uccaw kha nae uno hae ryte la neekuh oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Reuben phin hae, Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin angankuh tuh Kanaan ram lungkhu umpaw Shiloh khua e Israel hae kyate phiakuh hae zah, mih inn lang a ki hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses kya kaw a pya liate a ccou hae paw ram, Gilead ram langkhe ccia lan cite a thokuh hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Liathuinawpaw Silawhang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kanaan ram Jordan vaw pe he a thua hae tuh, Reuben phin hae, Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin angankuh nynh tuh-e Jordan vawkhu pe khe myarya lepaw silawhang ccangkheit a rae hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Reuben phin hae, Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin angankuh nynh Kanaan ramri kya Jordan vaw pe, Israel hae ram lungkhu khe silawhang a rae hae cipaw kha Israel hae nynh a thae hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel hae nynh tuh-e kong he a thae hae tuh, Israel hae mih balynte minmin kha tuk khylan Shiloh kya a pumkuh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Israel hae nynh Gilead ram kya-e Reuben phin hae, Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin angankuh hae kalan khe ranpibawi Eleazar ccapaw Finehas kha a saw hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te amaw ryte bawi lu haw, Israel phin raveih kyate lu kheit cci, mih phin kyate lu athua hae paw kha a cciasah bua hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Gilead ram kya um hae paw Reuben phin hae, Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin angankuh hae kalan khe cceih hae zah, minmin kha, <verse number="16" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw hae nynh mih balynte, ‘Israel Pachia tungvaw kya na rae oh paw rawsenaw hynh pawmou athua? Atunin <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha dou khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> laanpi kyate na cceihsei oh zah, silawhang ccangkheit na raeku oh paw hynh paw suilan mou athua?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:13-14">Deu 12.13-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Peor kya-e seinaw kha ah zawsakuh loh khyh oh tou! Khah-e seinaw keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw zapi hae kya shethya thua zah, atunin cia khah-e seinaw kyate ah thyaa loh khyh oh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-9">Nam 25.1-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />nanning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nulang zuiku leite atunin ccanglang na maekuh cih oh tou! Nanning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha atunin na dou oh ze, Israel ccungccaw zapi tungvaw awkhualan a thinria cih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama atu nae ram tuh athyaa khyh lanze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikbu a thadynnaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ram lungkhu lang oun cceihbua oh lah, kaening kae ccoupaw ram hynh lawkuh bua oh; thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> palia than nynh dou nan oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia kya-e silawhang laelan ccangpaw silawhang kha raekute kaening hynh mah oun dou nan oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pya vae paw uccaw konglang te Zerah ccapaw Akhan nynh a lungzi khyh keiccuze Israel ccungccaw zapi balyn tungvaw kya thinrianaw yn ccah khaw? Te aning a hoyleinaw keiccuze amaw kyalya chih khyh!’ a ci hae,” cite a hopya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:1-26">Jos 7.1-26</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Te Reuben phin hae, Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin angankuh hae nynh Israel puizia hae kya-e lupi hae kha khung hae zah, <verse number="22" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, pachia hae Pachia! <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, pachia hae Pachia! Aning nynh phe a ny; Israel maw nynh mah nyh sah! <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw dounaw te lungzi leinaw um zah, <verse number="23" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nulang zuiku leite ccanglang maeku khylan silawhang kha kae la rae lanze, atunin kae hiinnaw hynh oun haang nan oh; te tuh-e silawhang vawlan khe maee-ute silawnaw, ccathae silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw kha kae rae lan athua ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> amaw ccaccei nynh oun liaru vae sah. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae rae khyh, thuasalama malang ze nae ccaaw hae nynh kae ccaaw hae kha, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia te kyngkunaw pawmou na hoi oh? <verse number="25" style="v" />Pawccecize nanning Reuben phin hae te Gad phin hae, nanning te kaening laku kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jordan tuh ramri lang a rae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya nanning tuh ccou lanpaw nae hanpaw na hoibua khyh oh,’ a cisei cih hae cipaw kae tua keiccuze kae raepaw nynh thua. Tuhawte nae ccaaw hae nynh kae ccaaw hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beik lanpaw kha a umtawsahsei cih hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kaening nynh, ‘Maee-ute silawkunaw elang thua leite, <verse number="27" style="v" />kaening te nanning laku kya ccaekia thua zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rya tuh kaening nynh amaw malang maee-ute silawnaw te silawnaw hae te ccawkunaw silawnaw rya kae la lahbua ci nawlan, silawhang ccangkheit rae oh sih; malang ze nae ciihan hae nynh kae ciihan hae kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya ccoupaw pawsang na hoibua khyh oh,” cite a cisei khyh nawlan hae,’ cite kae ci. <verse number="28" style="v" />Te e hynh kaening kya thuasah, kae ciihan hae kya thuasah, hosei athua lanze, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> silawhang hynh dotua oh, kae minpaaw hae nynh silaw nawlan thua leite nanning te kaening lakuze ccaekia lang la rae hae paw hynhsa athua,’ cite kae ho cih cite kae tua. <verse number="29" style="v" />Amaw beikbu malang a thadynpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia kya-e silawhang laelan, maee-ute silawnaw te ccathae silawnaw athua khyhze silawnaw rae nawlan ccangpaw silawhang raete <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> laanpi kyate atunin cciaseite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> doupaw tuh kaening kyate sawkuh sah!” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ranpibawi Finehas te amaw kya um hae paw ccungccaw zapi kya-e piccan hae te Israel phin hae kya-e cciakhaetu hae nynh Reuben phin hae, Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin hae nynh a ho hae paw kha a thae hae tuh, mih lung myarya ccing. <verse number="31" style="v" />Te ranpibawi Eleazar ccapaw Finehas nynh Reuben phin hae te Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin hae tuh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha na rawse khyh oh keiccuze atunin <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh ah kya nynh um cipaw na ny oh; Israel ccungccaw hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih kyate atu na khum vae oh,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ranpibawi Eleazar ccapaw Finehas te bawi hae tuh Gilead ram te Reuben phin hae te Gad phin hae kyate Kanaan ram lang Israel hae kalan ki hae zah, bya kha oun thuakhae hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />E konglang te Israel hae nynh myarya mih lungrythua. Israel hae nynh Pachia kha thehoysah hae zah Reuben phin hae te Gad phin hae umnaw ram ro lan te minmin dou lanpaw konglang kha ho vae khyh hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Reuben phin hae te Gad phin hae nynh silawhang tuh Ed cite min a phu hae; “Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Pachia nynh thua cipaw hynh-e silawhang tuh aening laku kya ccaekia nynh thua,” a ci hae.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Joshua nynh Lungthosahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ccyh khaw cia aro koute Israel hae kha mih pepan e rhaw hae kyate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh haeungnaw a pya hae, Joshua tuh a kum yn tang zah myarya a taw te, <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel hae mih balynte, mih piccan hae, lu lang um hae paw, mih byapiatu hae te mih bawi hae kha Joshua nynh ko hae zah minmin kyakhe, “Atu tuh ka kum tang vae zah myarya ka taw vae; <verse number="3" style="v" />te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh e minphuin hae kyaze nae hanlan a raepaw kha na muih vae oh; pawccecize nanning hanlan rhaw ae tukpah oh paw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh thua. <verse number="4" style="v" />A laehy hae paw minphuin hae kha nae phin raveih hanlan rho lang kae pya oh, ka tae ty vae paw minphuin hae balyn hynh Jordan vaw kyate atho cih zah niccaw lang Rili Pi kyacia, <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nae malang kyate a dee cih hae zah, nae mit nynh a muih kho leinaw kyacia a dee cih hae; te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh bya ae kinpyaku oh hawte mih ram kha na ccou cih oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Moses kawbya ccauh kya azeikuhpaw balyn kha zui lan te rae lan kha tynkaring lan um oh, voilang ranglang maekuh nan oh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Nanning nynh nae laku kya a laehy ung hae paw minphuin hae ryte pyku leite, mih pachia hae min kha ho leite, tuh-e pachia hae min phyate byakinku leite, mih ryalawpya leite, mih malang bakhung leite, <verse number="8" style="v" />atunin cia na cyi oh hawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha tynkaring lan kyngkuh oh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawccecize le hae zah athungpaw minphuin hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae malang te a dee hae keiccuze atunin cia hum nynh san nae malang thadyn ngan khyh. <verse number="10" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh bya ae kinpyaku oh hawte, amaw tuh rhaw ae doupahtu oh paw athua keiccuze nanning kya-e lu kheit nynh rhaw thong kheit kha a dee kho.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:22">Deu 3.22</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 32:30">32.30</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia sungsah lanpaw kha hoyte raeringku tua oh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Na maetawkuh oh zah nanning laku kya-e a laehy ung hae paw ryte pykute nopi hae kha zu lang na dykuh oh zah minmin nynh mah ae dyru oh zetuh, <verse number="13" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh hynh-e minphuin hae hynh nae muihnaw kyate dee vae lan khyh hae cipaw kha ccaerarih lan nyh oh; thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya oh paw hynh-e ram hoy kyate na ro mawlaezung oh, nae hanlan kaang te saehung, nae ke hanlan ccungbua te nae mit lungkhu kya hinpaw lang a tang cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Te atu tuh laephi vawlan ccungccaw hae phung hawte ka cceihbua vae cih, nae balynte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nanning konglang te byakinnaw a raepaw uccaw hoypaw balyn ccangkheit san accakaepaw thua khyh cipaw kha nae thinlung te na tuanaw oh te na ny oh; nae hanlan marya accing, ccangkheit sanmah ahobounaw um khyh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh nanning kya bya ae kinpyaku oh paw uccaw hoypaw balyn tuh nae kya accing hawte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh hynh-e ram hoypaw ae pya oh paw kyate ae ro mawlaezung oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh uccaw hoy leipaw balyn kha nae tungvaw kya a thuasah cih. <verse number="16" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia nynh ae pya oh paw byakinnaw kha na ei oh zah, ccangpaw pachia hae kha ccianuate a rya kha na lawpah oh zah, a malang na bakhung oh zetuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh nanning kya maee hawte arua cih zah ae pya oh paw ram hoypaw kyate arangte na roh cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Joshua Hopaw Nyathya Bya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh Israel minphuin hae balyn kha Shekhem kya pum hae zah, Israel piccan hae, lupi hae, byapiatu hae te bawi hae kha a ko hae, te Pachia malang khe oun thua hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh ccungccaw hae balyn kha, “Israel Pachia nynh hynhte a ci: Langmawlya nae minpaaw hae tuh Zufrates vaw khuraw langkhe nynh a la um hae, Abraham te Nahor mih paaw Terah nynh ccangpaw pachia hae kha a la beik hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:27">Gen 11.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Te nae paaw Abraham tuh Vaw khuraw lang ka ko zah, Kanaan ram lungkhu khe phe lekuh lan ka cciakhae, a ciihan kha patae ka pungzaesah. Isak kha ka pya zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1-9">Gen 12.1-9</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 21:1-3">21.1-3</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Isak tuh Esau te Jakob kha ka pya. Te Seir muaram kha Esau ka pya, thuasalama Jakob te a ciihan hae kha tuh Izip lang a cceihbung hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:24-26">Gen 25.24-26</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 36:8">36.8</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 46:1-7">46.1-7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 2:5">Deu 2.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Te Moses te Aaron kha ka saw hae zah Izip tuh a lungkhu kya ka raepaw vawsawnaw khate de ka tah; te nyalangte nanning kha kae poukhae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:1-12:42">Exo 3.1—12.42</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Te nae paaw hae kha Izip kyate ka poukhae hae zah Rili Se kya a thua hae, te Izip ccungccaw hae nynh nae paaw hae kha marangle te marang rhawkaw ryte Rili Se kyacia a deehui hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.6-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:1-31">Exo 14.1-31</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha he a ko hae te, Izip ccungccaw hae te nae laku kya mohnaw a nung, te rili kha mih tungvaw lang ka luasah thin hae zah, tui pong ka vusah hae; nae mit nynh Izip tungvaw ka cyipaw kha a muih; te ramkaw kya khaw cia na la um oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te Jordan khuraw lang kya um hae paw Amor hae ram lang kae cciakhae oh; nanning kha ae dou oh zah, minmin tuh nae kuih kalan kae pya oh, mih ram tuh na lah oh zah minmin kha nae malang khe ka ro hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-35">Nam 21.21-35</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Zippor ccapaw Balak, Moab siapharan tuh thokuh zah Israel kha a dou. Te nanning kha thyalaw khylan ccungccaw saw hae zah Beor ccapaw Balaam kha a hyy.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.9-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-24:25">Nam 22.1—24.25</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama Balaam bya kha ka ngaepah khyh, tukeiccu aning nynh hythuanaw ae pya oh; hynhcite nynh nanning kha a kuih kyate kae thuaa oh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te Jordan vaw kha na zua oh zah, Jeriko kya na thua oh, Jeriko khua e ccungccaw hae te Amor ccungccaw hae, Periz ccungccaw hae, Hit ccungccaw hae, Girgash ccungccaw hae, Hiv hae te Jebus hae nynh zemah nanning kha ae dou oh; minmin tuh nae kuih kya kae pya oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Jos 3.14-17</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 6:1-21">6.1-21</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Te Amor hae siapharan lu ning kha nae malang kyate a deetu lang khoingae kha nae malang ka saw; nae thaloi te thua khyh, nae li nae the te thua khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:28">Exo 23.28</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:20">Deu 7.20</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Loo lang na pho boi leinaw oh ram te khua na la sah boi leinaw oh khua hae kha kae pya oh zah, tuin kya na um oh, na lin lei oh paw misu khokhu te oliv khokhu kya-e athae hae kha na ae oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:10-11">Deu 6.10-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tukeiccuze atu tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha rih oh lah, amaw rya kha lungthyaanaw te lungzinaw khate lawtua oh; Vaw khuraw lang te Izip ram kya nae minpaaw hae nynh a la beik hae paw pachia hae kha vua oh lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha beik oh. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha na beik ry khyh oh ze, atunin kya na beik lan oh paw kha pokuh oh; Vaw khuraw lang e ram kya nae minpaaw hae nynh a la beik hae paw pachia hae tou, tuhkhyhze na umnaw oh Amor hae pachia hae kha tou na pokuh cih oh; thuasalama kae te ka innbyn hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha kae beik cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ccungccaw balyn nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha pachia ccangpaw beik taw lan zah, vua lan kae ci boi lan khyh! <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia tuh kaening te kae minpaaw hae kha seetangnaw inn, Izip ram kyate oun poukhaetu te kae mit nynh a muihnaw kya syntawnaw alepi a raetu te kae ccianaw takyhte kae thuanaw minphuin hae balyn kyate oun hiinsahtu nynh thua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae malang e ccungccaw hae balyn, ram lungkhu um hae paw Amor ccungccaw hae kha a dee hae; tukeiccuze kaening mah kae Pachia athua keiccuze kae beik cih,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama Joshua nynh ccungccaw hae balyn kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rya tuh na lawpah kho khyh oh, pawccecize amaw tuh athyaapaw Pachia nynh thua; eiung mangpaw Pachia nynh thua; nae cyiseinaw thuasah, nae seinaw thuasah ae ngaethya lan khyh oh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Nanning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha na vua oh zah, ramccang pachia hae kha na beik oh ze, nae kya hoynaw a rae kou khate nynh yn paleihkuh cih zah, vawsawnaw ae pya cih oh, te marya ae roh cih oh,” a ci. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te ccungccaw hae balyn nynh Joshua kha, “Tuhte thua khyh, thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha nynh kae beik cih,” a ci hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh ccungccaw hae kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha beik lan na poku vae oh cipaw ccaekia tuh naemaw hynh nynh na thua oh,” a cipya hae. Te minmin nynh, “Ccaekia tuh kaemaw hynh nynh kae thua,” a ci hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Hynhte athua lanze nae kya umpaw ramccang pachia hae kha vua oh lah, nae thinlung te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kya beeku tua oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Te ccungccaw hae balyn nynh Joshua kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia tuh kae beik cih zah, amaw bya kha kae ngae cih,” a ci hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Joshua nynh tuin nin khe ccungccaw hae balyn ryte byakinnaw kha rae hae zah, minmin elang Shekhem kya phungbya te phungzae kha a raepya hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Te alepaw lung ccangkheit kha lah zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinnthyaa kya umpaw phaesi ku kaw khe a bing. <verse number="27" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh ccungccaw hae kha, “Dotua oh, e lung hynh aening kya ccaekia athua cih, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aening kya a hopaw balyn kha hynh-e lung nynh a thae; tukeiccuze Pachia kha na hynpya oh ze, e lung tuh nanning kha rawsete ccaekia lang a tang cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Te Joshua nynh ccungccaw hae kha a ccou hae paw mih ram langkhe a cciasah hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Joshua te Eleazar Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hynh-e koute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> seepaw Nun ccapaw Joshua tuh za kheit kum haw acih te a chih, <verse number="30" style="v" />te minmin nynh Gaash Mua palung lang, Efraim muaram kya umpaw, amaw nynh rho a ccoupaw Timnath-serah kyakhe a uu hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:49-50">Jos 19.49-50</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Joshua a hiin lungkhu balyn thuasah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae elang rya a lawpaw balyn a nyhtu hae Joshua nukhu e piccan hae she lungkhu balyn thuasah Israel hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a beik hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Israel hae nynh Izip ram kyate oun cciakhae hae paw Josef ru kha Jakob nynh Shekhem a paaw Amor a ccapaw kya-e phua za kheit te a repaw Shekhem khua e laephi kyakhe a uu hae; tuh-e hmin tuh Josef ciihan hae rho lang a tang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:19">Gen 33.19</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 50:24-25">50.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:19">Exo 13.19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:5">Joh 4.5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:16">Loc 7.16</ref></char></note> <verse number="33" style="v" />Te Aaron ccapaw Eleazar kha mah chih zah, amaw ccapaw Finehas nynh Efraim muaram kya a ccoupaw Gibeah khua khe a uu hae.</para>
</usx>